<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">YWN- Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">YWAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàsön Ywan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ywan</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ywn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàsön</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ywan</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ a Ywan, mbuur kàsön la ntööm Ywan awà kàkäl un'lɔŋki anà un'sam a Yɛsu Klistɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nde wa kàsön u Ɛfɛsɔ kà isii a mbul 85 ungö a mböör a Yɛsu Klistɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ya itàkal naa baar bàtaŋà bàkyàyöb Ndaa anà nsyääl a Yɛsu bàsön Màtay, Malakɔ anà Lukà, nde asaamà an'lɔɔŋ an'mwɛy mà Yɛsu anà indiir imwɛy byàlyaaŋ unsà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ntɔn mukwɛy ngyööb aba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nde un'kaan awà kàyöŋà abà:</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.1-18: imbuur a Mwan anà mbäl ande</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.19-4.54: mɛɛy atàtwɛb, idiim a tàtwɛb, mbaaŋ a tàtwɛb, aŋàlàkwikilà bàtàtwɛb</para>
  <para style="ip">- 5.1-12.50: làkwikilà anà mpem a bwoor, nsɔ̈ɔ̈l yan'bulà ngwal</para>
  <para style="ip">- 13.1-17.26: mbɔr a ntsüü a un'lɔɔŋ, ngyeel a nkalsà wumwɛy</para>
  <para style="ip">- 18.1-20.3: ntöön anà iböŋ: mwan awà bàpiy bwà, bàkyun'twey wàbalàbal.</para>
  <para style="ip">- 21.1-25: ntsülà: nkyɛɛŋ an'pà in'kɔk ande akà alɔŋki ande.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa yà pɛɛlà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>U nsɛmà kàkäl Ndaa, Ndaa kàkäl anà Nzam, Ndaa kàkäl Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Nde kàkäl u nsɛmà anà Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Indiir byanswà bàkyer u mbwo a nde, kà we anà undiir anki bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n akyer u mbwo a nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Mɔ̈ɔ̈ kàkäl amu nde, mɔ̈ɔ̈ wa kàkäl pɛɛlà a baar. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Pɛɛlà wàmunyɛŋ uboo a mpib, wɛɛ mpib bun'yöb anki. <verse eid="JHN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Kàkäl anà mbuur mwɛy, ntööm a Nzam, ikɔb ande Ywan. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Nde kàyi asànaa mbäl, ntɔn mutɛɛl pɛɛlà imbäl, ntɔn baar banswà bàsi làkwikilà u mbwo a nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Nde kàkäl anki pɛɛlà, wɛɛ nde kàkäl ntɔn mutɛɛl pɛɛlà imbäl. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ndaa kàkäl pɛɛlà a ndandaa. Kàyi nde u mɛɛn, nde àfàpà kyɛɛy akà mbuur wanswà.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Nde kàkäl u mɛɛn, mɛɛn màyàmɛnà u mbwo ande, wɛɛ mɛɛn mun'yöb anki. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Nde kàyi ntsü akà bànde ŋakwo, wɛɛ ba bun'wɛl anki. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Wɛɛ akà baar bun'wɛl, akà baar bàfàsà làkwikilà kà ikɔb ande, nde kapɛ ikɔ̈b mubulà baan a Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Baar abanà babör anki unsà an'kil, itàkal unsà ukwen a ndür, itàkal unsà ukwen a mbuur, wɛɛ unsà ukwen a Nzam.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Ndaa kàbwäär ndür, nde kàkäl uboo a bi, wàŋàyɔl a kab a ngway anà ndandaa. Bi kàkyàman làkoo ande, làkoo a Mwan baal mwɛy mpɛl kàfü akà Taa. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Ywan amun'tɛɛl imbäl, waa kan'kyään naa: « Le mbuur akwà kàtɛn mɛ naa: "Mbuur awayà ungö a mɛ kàfweel kusà a mɛ, ntɔn nde kàkäl kusà a mɛ." » <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Abun, unsà ukwà ande, bi banswà kàwɛl kab a ngway udu a kab a ngway. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Isàkal naa un'kɔɔn bàpɛ u mbwo a Mɔsɛ, kab a ngway anà ndandaa byàyi u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy kàmɛn anki Nzam akà ikikye, Mwan baal mwɛy mpɛl awà Nzam, awà uboo a Taa kà imɛɛy awà.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbäl a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Màt 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Le imbäl kàtɛ Ywan mpal amfum a Ayudà a Yɛlusàlɛm bun'tööm ba angaŋ anà alɛwi ntɔn mukun'fuul naa: « Ngye, ngye awà nà? » <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Nde kàkyer kyey mufuur, waa kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ, mɛ kà in'wà Klistɔ anki. » <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Waa ba bun'fuul naa: « Waa ngye awà nà bà? Nkye ngye awà Ɛli? » Nde kàfuur naa: « Aay, mɛ kà in'wà nde anki. » - « Nkye ngye awà Ŋangɔɔm? » Nde kàfuur naa: « Aay. » <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Abun, ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye awà nà bà? Ntɔn bi ikàpà mfuur akà baar bitöm. Ngye atɛn aben ntɔn ngye ŋakwo? » <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Nde kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">"ndaa a mbuur ifàsà in'kwɛŋ u nsye a ipɔl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">Làlɔ̈ɔ̈n alää mbwo a Mwol!" »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">asànaa kàtɛn ŋangɔɔm Yɛsay.<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Kyekà baar abà bàtöm bàkäl Amfarisi. <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Ba bàläb mufun'fuul, waa bàtɛn naa: « Isàkal naa ngye kà Klistɔ anki, itàkal Ɛli, itàkal Ŋangɔɔm, ntɔn nkye akadümà ngye? » <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Ywan kàfuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'kadümà kà an'dà. Uboo a bɛ we anà mbuur mwɛy mpa làyöb bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>nde wàmuyà ungö a mɛ. Mɛ in'kwe anki musɔɔl in'siŋ a idyäär ande. » <verse eid="JHN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Indiir abi byanswà byàlyaaŋà u Bɛtani, u sim a Yɔrdan, mper kàfadümà Ywan.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu, Mwan a un'kɔk a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Taaŋtyà, nde kan'man Yɛsu wàmuyà ntsü akà nde, waa kàtɛn naa: « Le Mwan a un'kɔk a Nzam awalwom man'be a mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Awà mbuur akwà kàtɛn mɛ naa: "Ungö a mɛ, we anà mbuur ayà, nde kàfweel itaan, ntɔn nde kàkyàtàkal." <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Mɛ ŋakwo sye kun'yöbà anki. Wɛɛ ntɔn nde muyàmɛnà akà un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl, waa mɛ kàyi mudümà kà an'dà. »<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Ywan kàtɛ imbäl ande naa: « Mɛ, mɛ kàmɛn Dweelà kan'fà du, kan'yàtyà asànaa yem, waa kàn'yàbwaay udu a nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Mɛ, mɛ kun'yöbà anki, wɛɛ mbuur akwà kan'töm mudümà kà an'dà, kan'kyään naa: "Mbuur ayàman ngye naa Dweelà kan'yàtyà anà kan'yàbwaay udu a nde, nde awun ayàdümà u Dweelà In'kyɛɛl." <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Mɛ, mɛ kàkyàman anà kàkyàtà imbäl naa nde, nde wà Mwan a Nzam. »<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Alɔŋki a Yɛsu bàtàtwɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Taaŋtyà, Ywan kàfàkal ikal nsil kya anà alɔŋki abɔ̈ɔ̈l uboo alɔŋki ande. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Mpal kàsyebà nde Yɛsu wàmulyaaŋ, nde kàtɛn naa: « Le Mwan a un'kɔk a Nzam! » <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Alɔŋki abà bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàwem ndaa kàtɛn Ywan, ba bàläb Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yɛsu kàbulà ungö, waa kàmɛn ba bàmuyun'lab, nde kafuul naa: « Ininà bɛ làleŋà? » Ba bàfuur naa: « Rabi - iswaŋà naa Un'lɔɔŋ - ngye afàkal ken? » <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làyi, waa bɛ làkàman. » Apan sye laa bun'läb ba, bàmɛn ba ikal kàfakalà nde, waa bàkäl apà nde ilä akin, la làkäl taaŋ lànà ungö a midi.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andrɛ, un'tɔŋ a Simɔn Petɔlà, kàkäl umwɛy uboo a abɔ̈ɔ̈l bàwem Ywan anà bàläb Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Kusà a nde mukàman mbuur asin, nde kàtàkàman un'tɔŋ ande ŋakwo Simɔn, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Bi kan'swaal Mɛsya! » Ikaswaŋà naa « Klistɔ ». – <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Nde kun'syen akà Yɛsu. Yɛsu kun'ler a lää, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye, ngye awà Simɔn, mwan a Ywan, ngye, ngye bàyabeelà Sɛfas. » Ikɔb aki ikaswaŋà naa Petɔlà.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo anà Natanayɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>U taaŋtyà, Yɛsu kàwɛl an'kyän mukyà Ngalilɛ. Nde kàbwey a Filipo, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Yan'läb! » <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Kyekà Filipo kàkäl un'nsi Bɛtesayidà, bul làmwɛy anà Andrɛ anà Petɔlà. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Nde kàkàman Natanayɛl, waa kun'kyään naa: « Bi, bi ban'swaal mbuur akwà bàsön unsà Un'kɔɔn a Mɔsɛ anà unsà aŋangɔɔm. Mbuur wa Yɛsu, mwan a Yɔsɛfi, un'nsi Nasàlɛr. » <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanayɛl waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Nkye undiir aŋàbwaŋ sye kan'kwo utoo u Nasàlɛr? » Filipo naa: « Yà, man. »<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Umpal kàmɛn Yɛsu Natanayɛl wàmuyàsin tsütsü apà nde, nde kàtɛn ntɔn nde naa: « Le un'nsi Isàlɛl umwɛy wà ndandaa, awà akɔ̈ɔ̈n loor uboo a nde. » <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanayɛl kun'fuul naa: « Ngye mɛ an'yöb aben? » Yɛsu naa: « Kusà Filipo mutabel, mɛ amɛn itaan umpal akäl ngye u ngyɛl a un'te a fige. » <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Apan Natanayɛl kàfàfuur naa: « Rabi, ngye, ngye awà Mwan a Nzam, ngye, ngye awà mfum a Isàlɛl! » <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Nkye ntɔn amakyään mɛ naa: mɛ amɛn u ngyɛl a un'te a fige, waa ngye an'sà làkwikilà? Ngye, ngye ayàman indiir mbɔɔn byan'söön bi. » <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Nde kàfàkwɛy naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, bɛ làsàman du lan'dubà, akyeey a Nzam bàmubeenà anà bàmutyà udu a Mwan a mbuur! »<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Un'kyɔm a bɔr u Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Kyekà, ilä kyàtär, kàkäl anà un'kyɔm a bɔr mwɛy u Kana, u Ngalilɛ. Ngwän a Yɛsu kàkäl kwo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yɛsu sye bàkyer un'bel anà alɔŋki ande kà un'kyɔm awà. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Yàmɛnà naa man màkyer awà. Ngwän a Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ba vin latɛy. » <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Un'kaar wà, ngye anà mɛ inina? Taaŋ amɛ ŋàtàkwo anki. » <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Ngwän waa kàtɛn a asyääl naa: « Làkyer yinà yanswà utɛn nde a bɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Paa màkäl anà an'buuŋ, an'buuŋ an'syaam mà nkɔŋ, amà bàfasyäälà Ayudà ntɔn mupöŋ ndür. U làbuuŋ làmwɛy man'kwo ibilà isii a an'litre an'kwem an'tär aŋitär. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yɛsu kàswɛŋ asyääl naa: « Làyööl an'dà uboo a an'buuŋ mà. » Ba sye waa bàyööl ma tii u mɔɔl. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Apanà, làtɛɛ an'dà anà làsyen ma akà mfum a un'kyɔm. » Ba waa bun'syeen ma. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Kàkyee nde, an'dà màkäl man'bulà vin. Nde kàyöb anki naa vin alà lan'fà ken. Wɛɛ asyääl bàtɛɛ an'dà bàkyer ayöb. Apan sye nde kàbel ŋabɔr, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Baar banswà bàfàtapà vin aŋàbwaŋ. Ungö, isàkal naa baar ban'yɔr, waa bapà vin làkɔ̈ɔ̈n ntsà. Wɛɛ ngye, ngye vin a ntsà akyer asàlɔɔn tii apanà! »<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Ayi nsɛmà a idiim a Yɛsu yàlyaaŋ u Kana a Ngalilɛ. Nde kàmɛɛy làkoo ande, alɔŋki ande waa bun'si làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàtyà Kapɛrnawum anà ngwän, anà atɔŋ ande anà alɔŋki ande. Ba kwo bàkyer anki ilä mbɔɔn.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu uboo a ndwà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Màt 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mlk 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Pak a Ayudà làkäl tsütsü mukwo, Yɛsu waa kàbeenà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Nde kàmɛn ayääl a ngɔɔmà, in'kɔk, an'yem anà agyɛɛŋ a ngim sye bàkyàbwaay uboo a ndwà a Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Abun, nde kàkyer füm a in'siŋ, waa kàböŋ ba banswà u ndwà a Nzam, anà ngɔɔmà, anà in'kɔk aba. Nde kàpay ngim a agyɛɛŋ anà kàbuum mɛsà aba. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Nde kàtɛn a ayääl a an'yem naa: « Làlwom indiir abi byanswà pà! Twon lan'buul ndwà a Taaràmɛ ndwà atà yà! » <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Alɔŋki ande bàyɔbà naa bàsön abà: « Ukwen a ndwà angye bàkyer asan'kwiiy. »<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Apan, amfum a Ayudà bun'fuul naa: « Idiim nà an'kwo ngye mukyer, ntɔn muswaŋ naa ngye awe anà ikɔ̈b mukyer abà? » <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Làbwaab ndwà a Nzam yi, ungö a ilä itär mɛ in'yàmbaar ya. » – <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Apan, Ayudà abà bàtɛn a nde naa: « Yàlɔ̈m mbul an'kwem an'nà aŋisyaam mutɔŋ ndwà ayi, wɛɛ ngye, ngye ya ayàmbaar ungö a ilä itär? » <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Wɛɛ, kyekà, ndwà a Nzam kàtɛɛnà nde yàkäl ndür ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Ungöngö, umpal kàwiyà Yɛsu uboo a akü, alɔŋki ande waa bàyɔbà naa nde kàkyàtɛn abà. Kyakin bàsi ba làkwikilà amu Ndaa Aŋàsɔn anà amu ndaa kàtɛn nde.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu akyàyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ mpem a mbuur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Utaaŋ kàkäl Yɛsu u Yɛlusàlɛm, umpal a un'kyɔm a Pak, bàmbɔɔn bàsi làkwikilà kà ikɔb ande ntɔn idiim kàfakyerà nde. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu, nde ba làkwikilà kasyeelà anki, ntɔn nde kàkyayöb ba banswà ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Nde kàkäl anki anà mfun naa bun'tɛɛl imbäl ntɔn mbuur, ntɔn nde ŋakwo kàkyer ayöbà naa ininà abyu mpem a mbuur.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Nàkàdim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Kàkäl anà mbuur mwɛy kiböl a Amfarisi ikɔb ande Nàkàdim. Nde kàkäl umwɛy uboo a amfum a Ayudà. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Nde kàyi u mpib akà Yɛsu, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Rabi, bi ikyàyöb naa ngye awà un'lɔɔŋ an'fà akà Nzam, ntɔn akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mukyer idiim asànaa afàkyer ngye, isàkal naa uboo ande Nzam watɛy. » <verse eid="JHN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ akyään: Isàkal naa mbuur bun'bör anki wàkün, nde ukwe anki muman Imwol a Nzam. » <verse eid="JHN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nàkàdim kun'fuul naa: « Nkye mbuur aŋànün kan'kwo bàfun'bɔr mbalà asin? Nkye nde kan'kwo ufàbilà mbalà yàyweel kà an'bäl a ngwän waa bàfun'bɔr? » <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ akyään: akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mubilà kà Imwol a Nzam, isàkal naa nde bun'bör anki kà an'dà anà u Dweelà. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Ayà ban'bɔr unsà un'sön yà un'sön, ayà ban'bɔr unsà Dweelà, yà dweelà. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Twon an'bem isàkal naa mɛ an'tɛn a ngye naa: "Yan'kwo naa bàfabɔr mböör a du." <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Un'pöb afàful mper ayà ukwen wa. Ngye awem làso awa, wɛɛ ngye ayöb anki naa wa kan'fà ken, itàkal naa wa sye akyà ken. Ayi yà ndaa ifàlyaaŋ uboo a mbuur wanswà awà ban'bɔr u Dweelà. »<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Apan Nàkàdim kun'fuul naa: « Ndaa ayi yan'kwo mukal aben? » <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ngye, ngye awà un'lɔɔŋ atoo làpan kà Isàlɛl, waa ngye indiir abi ayöb anki! <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ akyään: bi ifàtɛn ya iyöb bi, bi ifàtà imbäl a yakwà kàmɛn bi. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làkwen anki làkyey imbäl abi. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Isàkal naa bɛ làkakyeyà anki mpal alàkyäänà mɛ indiir a mɛɛn, bɛ làyàkyey aben isàkal naa mɛ amàlakyään indiir a du? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Ntɔn, akà mbuur ŋàtàbeenà anki du, nà Mwan a mbuur mpɛl awà kàfü du. <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Asànaa Mɔsɛ kàmbaar nde ntäy u nsye a ipɔl, abun sye bàsàmbaar Mwan a mbuur, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>ntɔn mbuur wanswà asà làkwikilà amu nde, ukäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Abun Nzam kàkwen mɛɛn mbɔɔn, lalan kàpɛ nde Mwan baal ande mwɛy mpɛl, ntɔn mbuur wanswà asà làkwikilà amu nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akyà bwà, wɛɛ nde ukäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Ntɔn Nzam kàtöm anki Mwan baal ande u mɛɛn ntɔn mudwa mbuur ndwà, wɛɛ ntɔn mɛɛn iwü mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Mbuur afàsà nde làkwikilà bun'tsüül anki nsaŋ. Mbuur mpa afàsà làkwikilà, bàkyun'tsüül mbar itaan, ntɔn nde kàsi anki làkwikilà amu ikɔb a Mwan baal mwɛy mpɛl a Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Nsaŋ ya yi: pɛɛlà làyi u mɛɛn, wɛɛ baar bàkwen làpib kà ikal a pɛɛlà, ntɔn nsyääl aba yàkäl yàmbe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Abun, mbuur wanswà afàkyer ube, nde kan'tɔn pɛɛlà anà nde sye kan'kaabà anà la, manà nsyääl ambe ande iyàmɛnà u leŋ. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Mbuur wanswà afàkyer ndandaa, nde afàyà ntsü awà pɛɛlà, ntɔn nsyääl ande amu Nzam imɛnà u leŋ. »<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Ywan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàkyen Yuday anà alɔŋki ande. Nde kàbwaay kwo anà ba anà kàpɛɛ ndüümà. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Ywan sye kàpɛɛ ndümà u Ɛnɔ tsütsü a Salim, ntɔn an'dà màkäl mbɔɔn kwo. Baar bàyee akà nde, waa bàwɛlà ndüümà. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Ntɔn Ywan kàkäl anki aŋàtàbilà bɔlokà.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Kyekà, nsyeel a mbaaŋ yàkyer abwà uboo a alɔŋki a Ywan anà Un'yudà mwɛy unsà ndaa iler mpɔɔŋà a ndür. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Ba bàyàman Ywan, waa bun'fuul naa: « Rabi, mbuur akwà kàkälà anà ngye u sim a Yɔrdan lumwɛy, nde akwà kàtɛɛlà ngye imbäl, le nde sye wàmupaa ndüümà anà baar banswà bàkyeenà akà nde! » <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Ywan kafuur naa: « Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki muwal undiir asin udu a undiir bun'pɛ fà du. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Bɛ, bɛ ŋakwo làbà ambäl amɛ mpal kàtɛn mɛ naa: "Mɛ, mɛ kà in'wà Klistɔ anki, wɛɛ mɛ in'wà mbuur bàtöm kusà a nde." <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mbuur awe anà un'kyay, nde wà un'dim. Wɛɛ akà un'sam ande afàkal ukɔl, wàmukun'wemà, ndaa a un'dim yàmukun'paa un'sak. Awà un'sak amɛ, wa wàŋàkwo. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Yubwaŋ naa nde uyɛl, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'tyà.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur kan'fà du</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>« Mbuur kan'fà du, wà udu a baar banswà. Mbuur awà u mɛɛn, wà mbuur a mɛɛn, ndaa ande yà ndaa a mɛɛn. Mbuur kan'fà du wà udu a baar banswà, <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>nde afàtà imbäl a indiir kàmɛn nde anà kàwem nde, wɛɛ akà mbuur mwɛy afàkyey imbäl ande watɛy. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Mbuur afàwal imbäl ande, kan'bɛɛrà inyɛm naa Nzam wà ndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Ntɔn mbuur kàtöm Nzam afàtɛn ndaa a Nzam, ntɔn nde afun'pà Dweelà aŋàkwo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Taa akwen Mwan, waa kàpɛ indiir byanswà kà an'kɔɔ ande. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Mbuur afàsà làkwikilà ande amu Mwan, we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. Mbuur mpa afàsà làkwikilà amu Mwan usàman anki mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ nkyɛl a Nzam isàkal udu a nde. »<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà un'kaar un'nsi Samalya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Mpal kàyöb Yɛsu naa Amfarisi bàwem naa nde kàfakyerà anà kàfadümà alɔŋki aŋàsöön Ywan, <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>- Kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ, Yɛsu kàfadümà anki nde ŋakwo, wɛɛ alɔŋki ande. - Mpal kàwem Yɛsu indiir bàtɛɛnà baar, <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>nde kàlwomà u Yuday, waa kàfurà Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Mukyà kwo, yàlɔ̈m naa nde atsul uboo a Samalya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Apan, nde kàtöl bul a Samalya mwɛy ikɔb a la Sikar, tsütsü a ywaŋ kàpɛ Yakɔb mwan ande Yɔsɛfi <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>ntsü làkäl fu a an'dà a Yakɔb. Ntɔn yɔ̈ɔ̈n a mbwo, Yɛsu kàkäl wàŋàbwaay kà un'beel a fu. La làkäl isii a taaŋ a midi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Un'kaar un'nsi Samalya mwɛy kàyi mutɛɛ an'dà. Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mpɛ an'dà anwà. » <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Ntɔn alɔŋki ande bàkäl aŋàkyà bul mukàsom isaa adyà. <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Wɛɛ un'kaar awà, un'nsi Samalya awà, kàtɛn a nde naa: « Aben? Ngye Un'yudà, ngye awe anà yɔr mulɔm an'dà anwà, akà mɛ, un'kaar mwɛy, un'nsi Samalya mwɛy? » - Kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ, Ayudà un'tüüb watɛy anà Asamalya. - <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ilàkal naa ngye ayöb kab a Nzam anà mbuur wa kan'tɛn wà a ngye naa: "Mpɛ an'dà", ngye mbuur alun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m an'dà, waa nde ulapà an'dà a mɔ̈ɔ̈. » <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Un'kaar waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, ngye akà kantin latɛy, fu a an'dà la sye làŋàtyà mbɔɔn. Ngye an'dà a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ma màfàken? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Nkye ngye an'söön taaràbi Yakɔb, mbuur kà ipɛ fu alà anà kànü an'dà mwo nde ŋakwo, anà baan ande anà itɔŋà ande? » <verse eid="JHN 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Mbuur wanswà anwà an'dà mà, afàsàwem mfwää a an'dà, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>wɛɛ mbuur asànwà an'dà insun'pà mɛ, nde ufàsàwem anki mfwää a an'dà akà ikikye, wɛɛ an'dà insun'pà mɛ isàbulà amu nde ntwà isàfuunà ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. » <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Apan, un'kaar kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, mpɛ an'dà ma, ntɔn mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n afàsàwem mfwää a an'dà, waa mɛ mpa in'fàsàyà mutɛɛ an'dà apà. »<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Kyen, un'bel un'dim angye, waa ayàfurà pà. » <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Un'kaar kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ un'dim watɛy. » Yɛsu naa: « Ngye awe anà iböŋ mutɛn naa: "Mɛ un'dim watɛy." <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Ngye kàkäl abà adim atyeen, baal awà ngye awà apanà, kà wà un'dim angye anki. Abun, ngye an'tɛn ndandaa. » <verse eid="JHN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Apan, un'kaar kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, mɛ in'manà naa ngye awà ŋangɔɔm. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Bàtaaràbi, bàfakömà udu a mɔŋ wà, wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làtɛn naa ikal kyan'kwo mukömà kyà u Yɛlusàlɛm. » <verse eid="JHN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'kaar, nkyey, taaŋ làmuyà alà mpa làsàkömà bɛ Taa itàkal udu a mɔŋ awà, itàkal u Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Bɛ, Asamàlya, bɛ làfàkömà Nzam mpa làyöb bɛ. Bi, Ayudà, bi ifàkömà Nzam iyöb bi, ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ afàyà u mbwo a Ayudà. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Wɛɛ taaŋ làmuyà, la sye lan'yà, mpal aŋankömà a ndandaa bàsakömà ba Taa u Dweelà anà u ndandaa, ba bà aŋankömà ufàleŋ Taa. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Nzam wà Dweelà, kyakin baar bàfun'kömà bun'kömà unsà dweelà anà unsà ndandaa. » <verse eid="JHN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Un'kaar waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'kyàyöb naa Mɛsya, iswaŋà naa Klistɔ, asàkyer ayà. Mpal usàyà nde, nde asikyään indiir byanswà. » <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà nde, mɛ mbuur in'yäämà wà anà ngye. »<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Umpal bàyàfurà alɔŋki, ba bàmɛn ndaa mwɛy yubem ntɔn nde kàkäl muyäämà anà un'kaar. Wɛɛ akà mbuur mwɛy uboo aba kàkwe anki mukun'fuul naa: « Ngye nkye akwen akà nde? » Sye naa: « Ininà ngye akayäämà anà nde? » <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Apan, un'kaar kàsàwɔm làbuuŋ ande paa, waa kàkyen bul, waa kàtɛn a baar naa: <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>« Yàlamɛn mbuur mwɛy kan'tɛn a mɛ indiir byanswà kàkyer mɛ. Nkye nde kà wà Klistɔ anki? » <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Kyakin bàtoo ba u bul, bàyi ba mper akà nde.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Apan sye, alɔŋki bun'siinà naa: « Rabi, dyà! » <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'we anà isaa adyà, isaa mpa làyöb bɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Kyakin alɔŋki bàtɛɛnà ba, ba a ba naa: « Nkye ikyàkal naa mbuur mwɛy kun'twääl isaa adyà? » <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Isaa adyà amɛ, byà ntɔn mukyer ukwen a mbuur kan'töm anà mukwey isal ande. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Bɛ, nkye bɛ làfàtɛn anki bɛ ŋakwo naa: "Yan'sal nsöŋ nà mubwo isaa." Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ alàkyään naa làduub mii abɛ, anà làler an'ywaŋ: mbɛŋ yan'söŋ anà yan'kwo mubwo! <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Un'bweel kan'wal làfur ande itaan anà kan'böbà mbɛŋ ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye, ntɔn mbuur kan'kɔn anà mbuur kan'bwo, bàmɛn un'sak ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Abà, un'sim afàtɛn ndandaa naa: "Umwɛy afàkɔn, umwɛy afàbwo." <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Mɛ, mɛ kàlatöm mukàbwo mbɛŋ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n aman bɛ mpay, baar asin bàsöön mwäänà. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ lan'bilà unsà bweel a isal aba. »<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Asamalya mbɔɔn bàsi làkwikilà amu Yɛsu ntɔn imbäl kàtɛ un'kaar naa: « Nde kan'tɛn amɛ indiir byanswà kàkyer mɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Undiir awun, mpal bàyàkɔlà ba tsütsü apà nde, ba bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n mukal anà ba. Yɛsu kàbwaay paa ilä byeel. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Abun sye, un'kàbɔ a baar kàsi làkwikilà ntɔn ndaa kàtɛɛnà nde ŋakwo. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Waa ba bàtɛɛnà a un'kaar naa: « Bi kan'sà anki làkwikilà ntɔn ndaa kà ikyään ngye, wɛɛ ntɔn bi ŋakwo kàmuwem, waa bi kan'yöb naa ndandaa nde wà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mɛɛn. »<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr mwan baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Ungö a ilä byeel, Yɛsu kàlwomà apan, waa kàkyen Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Nde kàkyään nde ŋakwo naa: « Ŋangɔɔm bàfun'pà anki làkoo u nsi ande ŋakwo. » <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Umpal kàtöl nde u Ngalilɛ, baar a itiir a nsi akin bun'wɛl ubwaŋ, ntɔn ba bàkyer aman indiir byanswà kàkyer nde kà un'kyɔm, ntɔn ba sye bàkyen un'kyɔm.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Apan Yɛsu kàfurà Kana u Ngalilɛ, ntsü kàbuul nde an'dà vin. Kàkäl anà undweer a mfum a aŋità mwɛy , mwan ande wàbaal kàkäl anà ukyal u Kapɛrnawum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Mpal kàwem nde naa Yɛsu kan'yà u Yuday a Ngalilɛ, waa kàkun'man anà kun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n naa nde utyà anà ukɔɔr mwan baal ande awà kàkäl tsütsü mukwà. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Isàkal naa bɛ làmɛn anki idiim anà impà, bɛ làsà anki làkwikilà akà ikikye! » <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Mfum aŋità awà kun'fuur naa: « Mwol, tyà kusà a mwan amɛ mukwà. » <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Kyen, mwan angye we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. » Mbuur awà kàsi làkwikilà u ndaa kàtɛn Yɛsu a nde, waa kàkyen. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Umpal kàkäl nde mutyà, baar a isal ande bàkàbwey ande, waa bun'kyään naa: « Mwan angye kan'wà mɔ̈ɔ̈! » <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Apan, nde kàfuul ba naa taaŋ nà mwan ande ukayà, ba bun'fuur naa: « Làbwɛy a mpye làlwomà ywenà, utaaŋ atàtwɛb, ungö a midi. » <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Taarànde kàyɔbà naa làkäl taaŋ nsil lalɛy alà kun'kyään Yɛsu naa: « Mwan angye we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ». Apan, nde anà ndwà ande yanswà bàsi làkwikilà amu Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Kyaki kyà idiim a impà kyàyweel kàkyer Yɛsu u mfuurà ande u Ngalilɛ fà Yuday.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr ikar mwɛy wàbaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Ungö a indiir abi byanswà, kàkäl anà un'kyɔm a Ayudà, waa Yɛsu kàbeenà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Kyekà, u Yɛlusàlɛm, tsütsü a munàmbwo a In'kɔk, kyàkäl anà itɛy a an'dà bàfàbel un'sà Ɛbɛlyɔ naa Bɛtesdà. Kya kyàkäl anà myäy, myäy in'tyeen. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Ungyɛl a myäy ami un'kàbɔ abɛy bàkäl musil: ikwàmii, aŋibweel anà ikar bàkäl mudil naa an'dà inini, <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>ntɔn utaaŋ làmwɛy un'kyeey a Mwol mwɛy kàfatɔlà uboo a itɛy, waa kàfanii an'dà. Un'bɛy atàtwɛb kàfatɔlà kan'dà aŋàni, kàkyer afakɔɔrà itàkal naa ukyal ande abɛy bàkaben. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Kwo kàkäl anà ikar mwɛy kàkäl anà ukyal mbul an'kwem an'tär aŋinaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Utaaŋ kun'mɛn Yɛsu wàŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà kàyöb nde naa nde kàbɛl itaan, nde kun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye akyàkwen akɔɔrà? » <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Ikar kun'fuur naa: « Mwol, mɛ in'we anki anà mbuur akan'tɔɔm uboo a itɛy umpal ifàsɛmà an'dà munini. Umpal in'kyà mɛ, mbuur asin kan'tɔɔmà kusà a mɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mbarà, sɛn ipɔy angye, kyen. » <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Apan sye, baal awà waa kàkɔɔrà, kàsɛn ipɔy ande, waa kàsɛmà mukyà. Kyekà, ilä akin kyàkäl ilä a saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Apan, amfum a Ayudà bàfuul baal awà kàkɔɔrà naa: « Ŋàbà ilä a saba, ngye mbwo musyen ipɔy angye yatɛy. » <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Wɛɛ nde kafuur naa: « Mbuur awà kan'kɔɔr, atɛn a mɛ naa: "Wal ipɔy angye, kyen." » <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Ba bun'fuul naa: « Nà mbuur awà atɛn a ngye naa: "Wal ipɔy angye, kyen"? » <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Wɛɛ mbuur awà kàkɔɔrà, kàyöbà anki naa nà kun'kɔɔr, ntɔn Yɛsu kàbilà uboo a iköŋ a baar bàkäl kà ikal akin.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Ungöngö, Yɛsu kàfun'man uboo a ndwà a Nzam, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Le, apanà ngye awà ŋàkɔɔrà. Twon an'fàkyer man'be, ntɔn undiir aŋàsöön ube ukɔɔn afayeel. » <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Baal awà kàkàkyään amfum a Ayudà naa Yɛsu kun'kɔɔr. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Lalan Ayudà bàmɛɛyà ba Yɛsu nkwaaŋ, ntɔn nde indiir abi kàkyerà ilä a saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Tii lalà Taa wàmusal, mɛ sye in'wàmusal. » <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Ntɔn ndaa ayi, amfum a Ayudà bàyileŋà ipöl mbɔɔn mukun'dwa, kànà ntɔn kàbɛyà nde saba anki, wɛɛ ntɔn kàtɛɛnà nde naa Nzam wà Taarànde ŋakwo, abà nde mumɛnà làsii làmwɛy anà Nzam.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikɔ̈b a Mwan a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Apan Yɛsu kàfàwal ndaa, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, Mwan ukwe anki mukyer akà undiir mwɛy nde ŋakwo, wɛɛ nà wa akwà ufàman nde mukyer akà Taa. Ntɔn indiir byanswà ufàkyer Taa, Mwan sye afàkyer bya. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Ntɔn Taa akwen Mwan, anà nde sye afun'swaŋ indiir byanswà ufàkyer nde ŋakwo. Nde afàsun'swaŋ indiir mwɛy byàkölàköl byan'söön abi ntɔn bɛ làsàkal unsà ubem. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Ntɔn, asànaa Taa ufàwiy nde akü anà ufapà nde mɔ̈ɔ̈, abun sye Mwan afàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ akà mbuur awukwen nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Taa ufàtsüül anki mbuur nsaŋ, wɛɛ nde ikɔ̈b atsul nsaŋ kyanswà kàpɛ akà Mwan, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ntɔn baar banswà bàsi Mwan làkoo asànaa bàfàsà ba Taa làkoo. Mbuur mpa afàsà Mwan làkoo, nde sye Taa awà kun'töm ufun'sà anki làkoo. »<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>Nde kàkwɛy naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, mbuur wanswà afàwem ndaa amɛ anà afàsà làkwikilà amu mbuur kan'töm, nde we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye, nde uyà anki u nsaŋ, wɛɛ nde kàkyàtoo itaan unsà ukwà, nde kàkyàwal mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alakyään, taaŋ làmuyà - la sye lan'kwo - alà bàsàwem akü ndaa a Mwan a Nzam. Baar bàsàwem ya, bàsàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Ntɔn, asànaa Taa awà nde anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amu nde ŋakwo, nde kàpɛ mbwo akà Mwan mukal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Nde kun'pɛ ikɔ̈b mutsul nsaŋ, ntɔn nde wà Mwan a mbuur. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Twon lan'man ndaa yubem unsà ya, ntɔn taaŋ làmuyà alà bàsàwem baar banswà abà uboo a an'dii ndaa ande. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Baar bàkyer indiir aŋàbwaŋ bàsàwiyà ntɔn muwal mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ baar bàkyer indiir ibe, ba bàsàwiyà ntɔn nsaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'kwe anki mukyer akà undiir mwɛy mɛ ŋakwo: mɛ in'fàtsul nsaŋ a ndaa in'fàwem mɛ, lalan mbar in'fàtsul mɛ yà balàbal, ntɔn mɛ in'fàleŋ anki ukwen amɛ ŋakwo, wɛɛ mɛ in'fàleŋ ukwen a mbuur kan'töm.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbäl ntɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>« Ilàkal naa mɛ kàtɛɛ imbäl ntɔn mɛ ŋakwo, kya kyàlàkal anki kyà ndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Wɛɛ mbuur asin afan'tɛɛl imbäl anà mɛ sye in'kyàyöb naa imbäl ufan'tɛɛl nde kyà ndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Bɛ, bɛ làtöm akyeey akà Ywan, nde waa kàtɛɛl ndandaa imbäl. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Akà mɛ, mɛ mfun a imbäl a mbuur kyatɛy, wɛɛ an'tɛn mɛ abà, ntɔn bɛ làwü mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Ywan kàkäl asànaa mwinà aŋàkyää wàmupà pɛɛlà: u taaŋ làmwɛy bɛ làkwen muman un'sak a pɛɛlà ande. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'we anà imbäl aŋàsöön kyà Ywan, ntɔn isal abyà kan'pɛ Taa mukyer, isal nsil bya in'fàkyer mɛ bi anà bya ifan'tɛɛl imbäl ntɔn muswaŋ naa Taa kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Taa awà kan'töm nde ŋakwo kàtɛ imbäl ntɔn mɛ. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làwem anki akà ikikye ndaa ande, bɛ làmɛn anki akà ikikye ntabwey ande. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Ndaa ande yatɛy amu bɛ, ntɔn bɛ mbuur kun'töm làfun'sà anki làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Bɛ, bɛ làfàlab pànsi pànsi Ndaa Aŋàsɔn, ntɔn bɛ làfàsi naa bɛ làwal mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a intye uboo aya: kyekà ya ŋakwo ifàtà imbäl ntɔn mɛ! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làkwen anki muyà akà mɛ ntɔn muwal mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>« Mɛ in'fàwal anki làkoo làfàfà akà baar. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Wɛɛ mɛ in'kyàyöb naa amu bɛ ukwen batɛy akà Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Mɛ, mɛ kàyi kà ikɔb a Taa, wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làtön mukan'wal. Isàkal naa mbuur asin kan'yà kà ikɔb ande ŋakwo, bɛ làkyer asun'wal! <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Aben, nkye bɛ lan'kwo mukal anà làkwikilà, bɛ baar làkoo abɛ làfàfà akà bɛ a bɛ, anà mpa làfàleŋ làkoo làfàfà akà Nzam mpɛl? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Bɛ twon lan'si naa mɛ in'sàkyer alafüün kusà a Taa. Mbuur afüünà bɛ Mɔsɛ awà làsi bɛ làkyän abɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Kyakin, yàlàkal naa bɛ làsi làkwikilà amu Mɔsɛ, bɛ làlàsà làkwikilà akà mɛ sye, ntɔn nde kàsön ntɔn mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa bɛ làsi anki làkwikilà u ndaa kàsön nde, bɛ lan'kwo aben musà làkwikilà u ndaa amɛ? »<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'dii abaal nsaab tyeen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Màt 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Ungö a indiir abi, Yɛsu kàsabà sim a ɛwà a Ngalilɛ lumwɛy, akyà bàfàbel sye naa Tibɛryade. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Iköŋ a baar mbɔɔn kyàkäl muyun'lab, ntɔn bàmɛn ba idiim kàkyerà nde udu a abɛy. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Kyakin Yɛsu kàbeenà nde udu a mɔŋ, kàbwaay nde paa anà alɔŋki ande. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Pak, un'kyɔm a Ayudà, làkäl tsütsü mukwo. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Kyekà, kàsɛn nde mii, nde kàmɛn iköŋ a baar mbɔɔn kyan'yà akà nde, nde kàfuul Filipo naa: « Bi kan'kwo musom ken mampà ntɔn baar bà bàdi? » <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>- Kàtɛn nde abà ntɔn mubilà Filipo u mpem, ntɔn akà nde, nde kàkyer ayöbà naa nde ininà uyàkyer. - <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipo kun'fuur naa: « Itàkal làfur a mbul mwɛy lun'syääl a an'ywaŋ làkwo anki musom mampà isàkal naa mbuur mbuur awal itàkal kitsu. » <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Umwɛy uboo a alɔŋki ande, ikɔb ande Andrɛ, un'tɔŋ a Simɔn Petɔlà, kàtɛn a nde naa: <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>« Mwan baal mwɛy awà apà, nde we anà mampà an'tyeen mà ɔrze anà bibaan a nsö byeel. Wɛɛ indiir abi nkye byan'kwo mukyer akà un'kàbɔ a baar? » <verse eid="JHN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Laswɛŋ baar bàbwaay. » Ikal akin kyàkäl anà in'lɛŋ mbɔɔn. Baar waa bàbwaay, ba bàkäl abaal isii a nsaab tyeen. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàwɛl mampà, kàfuur an'tɔɔn, waa kàkäb akà baar bàkäl paa. Nde kàkyer abun sye ntɔn nsö: nde kapɛɛ yinà yanswà bàkweenà ba muwal. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Umpal bàyüür ba, Yɛsu kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Làköŋà itiir byan'sal, ntɔn akà undiir ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akyà bwà. » <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Ba bàköŋà bya, waa bàyööl in'lwaŋ, in'lwaŋ kwem aŋiyweel a itiir a mampà an'tyeen mà ɔrzɛ byàsääl akà baar bàdi. <verse eid="JHN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Mpal bàmɛn baar impà kàkyer nde, ba bàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa mbuur awà, wà Ŋangɔɔm awayà u mɛɛn! » <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu, abà kàyöb nde naa ba bàkyer ayun'wal a ngwal ntɔn mukun'sà mfum, nde kàfàkyà u mpey aŋàyen udu a mɔŋ.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wàmuyikyà udu a an'dà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Màt 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Mpal làbü sisye, alɔŋki ande bàyàtyà kà un'kɔɔl a ɛwà, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>ba bàbilà u bwaar làmwɛy, waa bàsɛmà mubweel ɛwà ntɔn mukyà Kapɛrnawum. Làpib làkäl lan'bwà itaan, Yɛsu kàkäl anki aŋàtataan. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Un'pöb angwal kàkäl muful, ɛwà kyàkäl munini. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Ba bàkäl ban'kyer an'kilɔmɛtre an'tyeen, itàkal an'syaam, ba bàmɛn Yɛsu wàmuyikyà udu a an'dà, wàmuyàsin tsütsü a bwaar. Apan bɔɔmà làkyer akaar. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Wà mɛ, twon lan'man bɔɔmà! » <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Ba bàkwen mukun'wal u bwaar, wɛɛ la làkäl lan'tol u mɛɛn kà ikal akyà bàkyen ba.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iköŋ a baar kyàmuleŋ Yɛsu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>U taaŋtye, iköŋ a baar bàsàsal u sim lumwɛy, bàmɛn ba naa bwaar làkäl làmwɛy mpɛl paa, naa Yɛsu sye kàkyen anki mbwo mwɛy anà alɔŋki ande uboo a bwaar aba, wɛɛ ba, bàkyen ba mpɛl aŋàyen. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Apan sye, an'bwaar asin màfü Tibɛryade, màyàkɔlà tsütsü kà ikal bàdi ba mampà, ungö kàfuur Mwol an'tɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Wɛɛ utaaŋ kàmɛn iköŋ a baar naa itàkal Yɛsu, itàkal alɔŋki ande bàkäl anki paa, baar bàbilà kà an'bwaar, waa bàkyen Kapɛrnawum mukàleŋ Yɛsu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wà làmpà a mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Utaaŋ bun'mɛn ba u sim a ɛwà lumwɛy, ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Rabi, ngye apà an'yàkɔlà taaŋ nà? » <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, kà ntɔn impà làmɛn bɛ anki waa bɛ, bɛ làyan'leŋ, wɛɛ ntɔn làdi bɛ mampà anà làyüür bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Twon lan'sal ntɔn isaa abyà ifàtay, wɛɛ ntɔn isaa ifàlam ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye, bya akwà usàlapà Mwan a mbuur, ntɔn nde wà mbuur kàsi Taa Nzam inyɛm ande. » <verse eid="JHN 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Apan, ba bun'fuul naa: « Ininà bi kan'kwo mukyer ntɔn musal isal a Nzam? » <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Isal udilà Nzam akà bɛ kyà musà làkwikilà amu mbuur kàtöm nde. » <verse eid="JHN 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Apan ba bun'fuur naa: « Wɛɛ ngye, idiim nà ngye akyer ntɔn bi imɛn anà bi kasi làkwikilà? Ininà ngye afàsal? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Bànkaa abi bàdi mane u nsye a ipɔl, asànaa bàsön ya naa: "Isaa kapɛ nde mudyà byà làmpà làfü du." » <verse eid="JHN 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, kà Mɔsɛ tɛy kàlapɛ làmpà a du, wɛɛ Taa amɛ afàlapà làmpà a du là ndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Ntɔn làmpà a Nzam là mbuur kan'fà du anà kan'pà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mɛɛn. » <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Apan, ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, ipɛ taaŋ lanswà làmpà alà. »<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà làmpà a mɔ̈ɔ̈. Mbuur awayà akà mɛ usàwem anki ngyal akà ikikye, mbuur awà asà làkwikilà amu mɛ, usàwem anki mfwää akà ikikye. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Wɛɛ, mɛ ya kàkyàtɛn a bɛ naa: bɛ làkyàman, wɛɛ bɛ làsaa anki làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Baar banswà kan'pà Taa bàsàyà akà mɛ, anà mbuur ayà akà mɛ, mɛ in'sun'piy anki, <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>ntɔn kàyàtɔlà mɛ fà du, kà mukyer ukwen amɛ ŋakwo anki, wɛɛ mukyer ukwen a mbuur awà kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Le, ukwen a mbuur awà kan'töm abà: naa mbuur wanswà kan'pɛ nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akyà bwà, wɛɛ mɛ un'wiiy kà ilä a ntsüü. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Abun, ukwen a Taaràmɛ abà: mbuur wanswà aman Mwan anà asà làkwikilà amu nde, ukäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye, waa mɛ, mɛ in'sun'wiiy kà ilä a ntsüü. »<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Sɛmà apan, Ayudà bàbulà muŋüŋün ntɔn kàtɛn nde naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà làmpà làfü du. » – <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Ba waa bàfatɛɛnà naa: « Nkye nde kà Yɛsu, mwan a Yɔsɛfi anki? Nkye bi taarànde anà ngwän kayöb anki? Aben nde kan'kwo mukyey uyɔl apanà naa: "Mɛ an'yàtɔlà fà du"? » <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Twon lan'ŋüŋün bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki muyà akà mɛ isàkal naa Taa awà kan'töm kun'naan anki, waa mɛ, mɛ insun'wiiy kà ilä a ntsüü. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Aŋangɔɔm bàsön abà: "Nzam asàlɔŋ ba banswà." Mbuur wanswà kàwem Taa anà kàkyey an'lɔɔŋ ande, ayà akà mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Ikaswaŋà naa akà umwɛy kàmɛn anki Taa akà ikikye, nà mbuur mwɛy awà kàfü akà Nzam, nde awà kàmɛn Taa. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään: mbuur asà làkwikilà we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'wà làmpà a mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Bànkaa abɛ bàdi manɛ u nsye a ipɔl, wɛɛ ba bàkyàkwà. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Wɛɛ làmpà làyàtɔlà fà du, là naa mbuur adyà la ukɔɔn akwà. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'wà làmpà alye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ làfü du. Isàkal naa mbuur kan'dyà unsà làmpà alà, nde asàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. Làmpà alà in'sàpà mɛ, lun'sön a ndür amɛ an'pà mɛ ntɔn mɛɛn ikäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. »<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Apan, Ayudà bàsyeelà mbaaŋ a ngwalàngwal ba a ba: « Aben mbuur wà kan'kwo mupà bi un'sön a ndür ande naa bàdi wa? » <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Abun, Yɛsu kakyään naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään: isàkal naa bɛ làdi anki un'sön a ndür a Mwan a mbuur anà bɛ lànü anki an'kil ande, bɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ làsàkal awà anki. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Mbuur awadyà un'sön a ndür amɛ anà anwà an'kil amɛ, nde we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye, waa mɛ, mɛ insun'wiiy kà ilä a ntsüü. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ntɔn un'sön a ndür amɛ wà isaa a ndandaa byàdyà anà an'kil amɛ mà man a ndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Mbuur awadyà un'sön a ndür amɛ anà anwà an'kil amɛ, nde wà amu mɛ anà mɛ in'wà amu nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Asànaa Taa awà kan'töm awà nde anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, mɛ sye in'wà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo ande. Abun, mbuur asan'dyà, nde asàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo amɛ: <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Alà là làmpà làyàtɔlà fà du. La kà latɛy asànaa la akwà bàdi bànkaa abɛ. Ba, ba bàkyàkwà. Wɛɛ mbuur asàdyà làmpà là, nde asàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. » <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Indiir abi nde kàlɔɔŋà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà u Kapɛrnawum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Ungö bàwem ba Yɛsu, bàmbɔɔn uboo a alɔŋki ande bàtɛn naa: « Ndaa ayi yà bwoor! Nà kan'kwo muwem ya? »<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Wɛɛ nde kayöb nde ŋakwo naa alɔŋki ande bàkäl mukun'twe ntɔn ndaa ayi, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye ndaa ayi yàmàladii ukyal? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Akya isàkal naa bɛ lan'man Mwan a mbuur wàmubɛɛnà mper kàkäl nde kusà? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Dweelà làfàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ un'sön a ndür wà undiir mwɛy ndöŋ watɛy. Ndaa an'tɛn mɛ a bɛ yà dweelà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Wɛɛ bamwɛy uboo abɛ bàfàsà anki làkwikilà. » Abun, Yɛsu kàkyer ayöbà fà nsɛmà naa bànà mpa bàsye làkwikilà anà nà kàlun'yälà. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Nde kàkwɛy naa: « Kyakin kàlakyään mɛ naa: "akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe tɛy muyà akà mɛ, isàkal naa ya Taa kun'pɛ anki." »<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Fà apan, alɔŋki ande mbɔɔn bàkyer alwomà, waa bàwɛy muyikyà anà nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel naa: « Atöl bɛ, nkye bɛ làkwen anki mukyà? » <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kun'fuur naa: « Mwol, bi ikyà akà nà? Ngye awe anà ndaa a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Bi, bi kàkyàsà làkwikilà anà kàkyàyöb naa ngye, ngye awà Ŋun'kyɛɛl a Nzam. » <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Nkye kà mɛ anki kàlasɔ̈ɔ̈l, bɛ Bàkwem Aŋiyweel? Kyekà umwɛy uboo abɛ wà ileŋ! » <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Abun, nde kàtɛɛnà ntɔn Yudasi, Mwan a Simɔn Isikalyɔt. Ntɔn nde wumwɛy uboo a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel awà kàlun'yälà.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a làkwikilà a atɔŋ a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàyilyaaŋà u Ngalilɛ. Nde kàkwen anki muyilyaaŋ u Yuday, ntɔn amfum a Ayudà bàleŋà mukun'dwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Kyekà, un'kyɔm a ndwà a ntɛn a Ayudà kàkäl tsütsü. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Apan, atɔŋ a Yɛsu bàtɛn a nde naa: « Lwomà apà, kyen Yuday, ntɔn alɔŋki angye sye bàmɛn isal akyerà ngye bi. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy ufàkyer anki undiir u nku isàkal naa nde akwen umɛnà. Ntɔn akakyerà ngye indiir abi, wɛy ngye ŋakwo sye amɛnà u mii a baar. » <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Abun, atɔŋ ande ŋakwo bun'si anki làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Taaŋ amɛ ŋàtàkwo anki. Wɛɛ akà bɛ, taaŋ lanswà là ubwaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Mɛɛn ikwe tɛy mukàlayiiŋ, wɛɛ mɛ, nde akyer afan'yiiŋ, ntɔn mɛ in'fàtà imbäl naa isal ande byà ibe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Kyakin, bɛ, bɛ làbeenà un'kyɔm. Akà mɛ, mɛ in'beenà tɛy un'kyɔm, ntɔn taaŋ amɛ ŋàtàkwo anki. » <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Ungö mutɛn abà, nde kàsàbwaay u Ngalilɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kà un'kyɔm a ndwà a ntɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Wɛɛ mpal bàkyen atɔŋ ande un'kyɔm, apan, nde sye kàbeenà aŋàyen, kà u mii a baar anki, wɛɛ asànaa u nku. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Umpal a un'kyɔm, amfum a Ayudà bàyun'leŋà ba, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Wàken nde bà? » <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Baar bàsyeelà mbaaŋ mbɔɔn ntɔn nde uboo a nköŋ. Amwɛy naa: « Nde wà mbuur aŋàbwaŋ ». Wɛɛ bumwɛy naa: « Ŋaa, nde wà muyibwiy baar ndwaŋ. » <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Itàkal abun, akà mbuur mwɛy kàtɛɛnà anki u mii a baar, ntɔn ba bàtiinà amfum a Ayudà bɔɔmà.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Un'kyɔm kàkäl kan'tol uboboo, Yɛsu kàbeenà ndwà a Nzam, waa kàlɔɔŋà. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Amfum a Ayudà bàmɛn ndaa yubem, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Aben nde uyöbà, nde mbuur mpa kàtäŋ? »<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « An'lɔɔŋ amɛ kà man'fà akà mɛ anki, wɛɛ màmbuur kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Isàkal naa mbuur akwen mukyer ukwen a Nzam, nde asàyöb naa nkye an'lɔɔŋ amà man'fà akà Nzam, lɛɛ mɛ in'wà mutɛn kà ikɔb amɛ ŋakwo. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Mbuur afàtɛn ntɔn nde ŋakwo, afàleŋ làkoo ande ŋakwo. Wɛɛ mbuur afàleŋ làkoo a mbuur kun'töm, nde wà mbuur a ndandaa, usɔɔr akà nde batɛy. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Nkye kà Mɔsɛ anki kàlapɛ Un'kɔɔn? Wɛɛ akà umwɛy uboo abɛ ufàsyääl anki wa. Ntɔn nkye làkwen bɛ mukan'dwa? » <verse eid="JHN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Iköŋ a baar kyun'fuur naa: « Ngye awe anà un'sɔŋà! Nà akwen akadwa? »<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ an'kyer isal imwɛy, wɛɛ bɛ banswà, bɛ lan'bem! <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Ntɔn Mɔsɛ kàlaswɛŋ mukyɛy baan abaal - ya sye yàfü anki akà Mɔsɛ, wɛɛ yàfü akà bànkaa - waa bɛ làfàkyɛy baal mwɛy ilä a saba. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Isàkal naa bɛ lan'kwo mukyɛy baal mwɛy ilä a saba ukɔɔn abɛy Un'kɔɔn a Mɔsɛ, ntɔn nkye làman'wem bɛ nkyɛl ntɔn an'kɔɔr mɛ baal aŋun'kiinà ilä a saba? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Twon lan'tsul mbar ntɔn ubwaŋ a nsà, wɛɛ làtsül mbar a balàbal. »<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkye Yɛsu wà Klistɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Ndam a baar uboo a baar a Yɛlusàlɛm bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nkye wà kà mbuur bàyileŋ ba mudwa anki? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Le, nde wàmutɛn u mii a baar, wɛɛ akà mbuur a un'sà nso watɛy! Nkye amfum abi ban'kyey naa ndandaa nde wà Klistɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Mpal usàyà Klistɔ, akà mbuur mwɛy usàyöb anki ntsü kan'fà nde. Wɛɛ baal wà, bi ikyàyöb ntsü kan'fà nde. »<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Apan, umpal kàlɔɔŋà Yɛsu u ndwà a Nzam, nde kàsi un'kwɛŋ: « Bɛ, bɛ làkyan'yöb! Bɛ làkyàyöb ntsü an'fà mɛ! Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ kàyi anki mɛ ŋakwo, mbuur awà kan'töm wà ndandaa. Bɛ, bɛ lun'yöb anki. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'kyun'yöb, ntɔn mɛ kàfü akà nde, nde sye kan'töm. » <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Apan, ba bàleŋ mukun'kɔr, wɛɛ akà mbuur kun'bä anki, ntɔn taaŋ ande làkäl aŋàkwo anki. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Uboo a iköŋ, baar mbɔɔn bàsi làkwikilà amu nde. Ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nkye mpal usàyà Klistɔ, nde asàkyer impà aŋàsöön abyà ukyerà mbuur wà? »<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aseey ntɔn mukɔr Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>In'ŋün myàkäl uboo a iköŋ a baar ntɔn Yɛsu, myàyàböl kà an'tsü a Amfarisi. Apan, andwer a angaŋ anà Amfarisi waa bàtöm aseey ntɔn mukun'kɔr. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà anà bɛ taaŋ ikikye, ungö mɛ in'kyà ntsü akà mbuur kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Bɛ làkyer asan'leŋ, wɛɛ bɛ làsan'man tɛy, ntɔn bɛ làkwe anki muyà kà ikal in'sàkal mɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Fà apan, amfum a Ayudà bàsɛmà mufuul ba a ba naa: « Nde apɛy ayàkyà ken ntɔn bi ifàkɔɔn un'man? Nkye nde apɛy ayàkàtaan Ayudà akwà bàpää uboo a Angɛlɛki? Nkye nde apɛy Angɛlɛki usàkàlɔŋ? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Ikaswaŋà aben ndaa utɛn nde ayɛy naa: "Bɛ, bɛ làkyer asan'leŋ, wɛɛ bɛ làsan'man tɛy, naa sye bɛ làkwe tɛy muyà kà ikal in'sàkal mɛ"? »<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyäl a an'dà a mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Ilä a ntsüü a un'kyɔm kyàkäl ilä mwɛy kyà kölàköl. Yɛsu kàkäl umbär wàmukyäänà naa: « Isàkal naa mbuur we anà mfwää, wɛy nde uyi akà mɛ, waa unwà. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Mbuur awe anà làkwikilà amu mɛ, "ngyäl a an'dà a mɔ̈ɔ̈ isàtoo u mpem ande", asànaa itɛɛnà Ndaa Aŋàsɔn. » <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Kàtɛɛnà nde abunà, yà ntɔn Dweelà bàlàwal baar bàlàsà làkwikilà aba amu nde. Umpal ayin, Dweelà kàkäl aŋàtàpà anki, ntɔn Yɛsu kàkäl anki aŋàtàwal làkoo.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iköŋ kyan'kaabà ntɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Amwɛy uboo iköŋ bàwem ndaa ayi, ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Ndandaa mbuur awà, wà Ŋangɔɔm! » <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Bumwɛy bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde wà Klistɔ! » – Wɛɛ bumwɛy bàfuur naa: « Nkye Klistɔ sye an'kwo utoo u Ngalilɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Nkye Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛɛnà anki naa nde asàkal mbuur a ywar a David, nde asàfà Bɛtelɛm, bul kàkälà David? » <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Apan, iköŋ kyàkaabà ntɔn nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Amwɛy uboo a ba bàkweenà naa bun'kör, wɛɛ akà mbuur mwɛy kàkwe anki mukun'ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a làkwikilà a amfum a Ayudà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Aseey bàyàfurà ba akà andweer a angaŋ anà Amfarisi, ba bafuul naa: « Ntɔn nkye mpa làtwääl bɛ Yɛsu? » <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Aseey bàfuur naa: « Akà mbuur mwɛy ŋàtàtɛn anki akà ikikye asànaa nde! » – <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Apan, Amfarisi bafuul naa: « Nkye anà bɛ sye, nde akyàlabwiy ndwaŋ? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Nkye we anà umwɛy uboo a amfum itàkal uboo a Amfarisi, kàsi làwikilà amu nde? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Wɛɛ baar abà, baar mpa bàyöb Un'kɔɔn akà ikikye, ba bàŋàküül! »<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Wɛɛ umwɛy uboo a Amfarisi, Nàkàdim akwà kàkàman Yɛsu itaan, kàtɛn a ba naa: <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>« Nkye Un'kɔɔn abi afàtsüül mbuur mbar ukɔɔn atun'wem anà muyöb naa nde nkye kan'kyer? » <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Nkye ngye sye awà un'nsi Ngalilɛ? Leŋ, ngye ayàman naa akà ŋangɔɔm mwɛy ufàtoo anki u Ngalilɛ akà ikikye. »<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Ungö apan, mbuur mbuur kàfurà ndwà ande.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà un'kaar inswem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yɛsu kàkyen mɔŋ a In'te a olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Ututu tutu, nde kàyàfurà u ndwà a Nzam. Un'sɛŋ a baar wanswà kàyi akà nde, nde waa kàbwaay, waa kàsɛmà mulɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Apan, alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn anà Amfarisi bun'twääl un'kaar mwɛy bàkör ba wàmutà inswem, waa bun'tɔɔl uboboo a baar banswà, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>waa bàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, un'kaar wà bàmun'kɔr wàmutà inswem. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Unsà un'kɔɔn, Mɔsɛ kà iswɛŋ mutà akaar a tub abà in'kul. Waa ngye, ngye an'tɛn aben bà? »<verse eid="JHN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Bàtɛɛnà ba abà ntɔn ba bun'lwɛb ndaa, anà ba bàkäl anà undiir ban'kwo ba mukun'füün. Wɛɛ Yɛsu waa kàtsüüm, kàsɛmà mubaar in'dyärà a làpin u mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Ntɔn bàsi ba muküünà mukun'fuul, Yɛsu kàsuub un'tswe, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Isàkal naa apà we anà mbuur mwɛy uboo a bɛ mpa aŋàtàkyer man'be akà ikikye, wɛy nde kun'käm un'kul atàtwɛb. » <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Ungö, kàfàtsüüm nde, nde kàsön u mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Ungö bàwem ba ndaa ayi, ba bàsɛmà mutà upay umwɛy umwɛy, semà akà andweer. Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàsàsal aŋàyen, un'kaar kàkyàmbar kusà a nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàsuub nde un'tswe, waa kun'fuul naa: « Un'kaar, bàken ba? Nkye akà mbuur akyapà ikwàndwà? » – <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Nde kàfuur naa: « Ŋaa, Mwol, akà mbuur. » Waa Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mɛ sye, mɛ apà anki ikwàndwà. Kyen, twon an'fàkyer man'be. »<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wà pɛɛlà a mɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà pɛɛlà a mɛɛn. Mbuur ayan'lab, nde usàkyà anki u mpib akà ikikye, nde asàwal pɛɛlà làfàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈. » <verse eid="JHN 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Apan, Amfarisi bàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye, ngye awàmutà imbäl angye ŋakwo. Imbäl angye kà kyà ndandaa anki. » <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Yà ndandaa naa mɛ, mɛ in'wàmutà imbäl amɛ ŋakwo. Imbäl amɛ kyà ndandaa, ntɔn mɛ in'kyàyöb naa mɛ an'fà ken anà mɛ sye in'kyà ken. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làyöb anki naa mɛ an'fà ken anà mɛ sye in'kyà ken. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Bɛ, bɛ nsaŋ làfàtsul unsà imbuur. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'fàtsüül anki mbuur nsaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Mpalabà, isàkal naa mɛ in'kyer atsul nsaŋ, ntsüül a nsaŋ amɛ yà balàbal, ntɔn mɛ kà in'wà aŋàyen anki, wɛɛ mɛ in'wà anà Taa, mbuur awà kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Bàsön unsà Un'kɔɔn abɛ ŋakwo naa bàfàtɔn anki imbäl a baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'fàtà imbäl amɛ ŋakwo, Taa awà kan'töm afan'tɛɛl sye imbäl. » <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Apan ba bàtɛɛnà a nde naa: « Wàken Taaràŋà wa? » Yɛsu naa: « Bɛ, bɛ mɛ lan'yöb anki, itàkal Taaràmɛ, bɛ lun'yöb anki. Ilàkal naa bɛ lan'yöb, bɛ sye Taaràmɛ làkyer alun'yöb. »<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Ndaa ayi, Yɛsu ya kàtɛɛnà umpal kàlɔɔŋà nde u ndwà a Nzam, kà ikal a insak a an'kab. Akà mbuur mwɛy kàkwe anki mukun'kɔr, ntɔn taaŋ ande làkäl aŋàkwo anki.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">« Bɛ, bɛ làkwe anki mukyà mper ayà in'kyà mɛ »</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'kyer ayàkyà, bɛ làkyer ayan'leŋ, wɛ bɛ, bɛ làsàkwà unsà ube abɛ. Bɛ làkwe anki mukyà mper in'kyà mɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Apan amfum a Ayudà bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nkye nde we anà an'kyän mudwa nde ŋakwo, ntɔn nde wàmutɛn naa: "Bɛ làkwe anki mukyà mper in'kyà mɛ"? » <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Bɛ, bɛ làbà baar a indiir a mɛɛn mà. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'wà mbuur a indiir a dudu. Bɛ, bɛ làbà baar a mɛɛn mà, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ kà in'wà mbuur a mɛɛn mà anki. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Undiir awun in'tɛn mɛ a bɛ naa bɛ làsàkwà unsà man'be abɛ. Abun, isàkal naa bɛ làkyey anki naa "Mɛ In'wà", bɛ làsàkwà unsà man'be abɛ. » – <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Ba bun'fuul naa: « Ngye, ngye awà nà? » Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Mbuur akwà kàlakyään mɛ fà nsɛmà. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'we anà indiir mbɔɔn mutɛn anà mutsul nsaŋ ntɔn bɛ. Wɛɛ mɛ in'fàkyään u mɛɛn nà ya akwà kàwem mɛ akà mbuur kan'töm, nde afàtɛn ndandaa. »<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Wɛɛ ba bàyöbà anki naa nde ba kasaamà ntɔn Taa. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Utaaŋ làsàsɛɛn bɛ Mwan a mbuur, bɛ laa làsàyöb bɛ naa "Mɛ In'wà", anà mɛ in'fàkyer anki undiir kà ukwen amɛ ŋakwo: mɛ in'fàtɛn ya akwà kan'lɔŋ Taa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Mbuur kan'töm wà anà mɛ: nde kan'wɛy anki aŋàyen, ntɔn mɛ, taaŋ lanswà mɛ in'fàkyer indiir ufàkwen nde. » <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Umpal kàkäl nde mutɛɛnà abà, baar mbɔɔn bàsi làkwikilà amu nde.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baar a nsaay anà asɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Abun Yɛsu kàtɛn a Ayudà abà bàsi làkwikilà amu nde naa: « Isàkal naa bɛ, bɛ lan'lam u ndaa amɛ, ndandaa bɛ làbà alɔŋki amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Abun, bɛ làsàyöb ndandaa, waa ndandaa isàlabuul baar a nsaay. » <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Bi, bi ibà itoo a Abàlam, bi kàsàkal anki asɔ a mbuur mwɛy akà ikikye. Aben ngye, ngye atɛɛnà naa: "Bɛ làsàbulà baar a nsaay"? » <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään: mbuur wanswà afàkyer man'be, nde wà un'sɔ a man'be. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Un'sɔ ufàbwaay anki ipepey u ndwà, wɛɛ mwan afàbwaay ipepey kwo. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Abun, isàkal naa Mwan kàmàlakɔɔr, bɛ làsàkal baar a nsaay bàndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Mɛ in'kyàyöb naa bɛ làbà itoo a Abàlam, wɛɛ bɛ làfàleŋ mukan'dwa, ntɔn ndaa amɛ ifàlatwà anki u mpem. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'fàtɛn indiir kàmɛn mɛ akà Taa. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làfàkyer indiir làwem bɛ akà taaràbɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Abàlam wà taaràbi. » Yɛsu naa: « Kya bɛ làlàkal baan a Abàlam, bɛ làlikyerà isal a Abàlam. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Wɛɛ apanà, bɛ, bɛ làleŋà mukan'dwa, mɛ mbuur kàlakyään ndandaa ayà kàwem mɛ akà Nzam. Abàlam kàkyer anki abà! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làfàkyer isal a taaràbɛ. » Ba bun'fuur naa: « Bi kà ibà baan a inswem anki. Bi ibye awà Taa mwɛy mpɛl, Nzam. » <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Yàlàkal naa Nzam wà Taaràbɛ, bɛ làlàkyer an'kwen. Ntɔn mɛ, mɛ an'too amu Nzam anà mɛ sye an'fà kwo. Mɛ, mɛ kàyi anki a ukwen amɛ ŋakwo, wɛɛ Nde kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Ntɔn nkye mpa làkayöbà bɛ ntɛɛn amɛ? Ntɔn bɛ, bɛ làkwe anki muwem ndaa amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Bɛ, taaràbɛ ileŋ, bɛ làfàkwen mukyer ngyal a taaràbɛ. Nde wun'dwää fà nsɛmà, nde kàsàtsim anki uboo a ndandaa, ntɔn ndandaa amu nde yatɛy. Umpal ufàtà nde loor, nde la afàwal uboo a indiir ande ŋakwo, ntɔn nde wà ŋaloor anà taar a loor. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Wɛɛ, mɛ in'fàtɛn ndandaa, undiir awun mpa làfan'sà bɛ làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nà uboo abɛ kan'kwo mukan'swaŋ naa mɛ an'kyer man'be? Ntɔn nkye lan'kɔɔn bɛ mukan'sà làkwikilà isàkal naa mɛ an'tɛn ndandaa? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Mbuur awà mbuur a Nzam, afàwem ndaa a Nzam. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làfàwem anki, ntɔn bɛ kàlàbà baar a Nzam anki. »<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Abàlam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayudà bun'fuur naa: « Nkye bi iböŋ kyatɛy mutɛn naa ngye awà un'nsi Samalya, anà ngye sye awe anà unsɔŋà? » – <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ unsɔŋà watɛy. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'wàmusyäŋà Taaràmɛ. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làkun'syäŋà anki. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'fàleŋ anki làkoo amɛ ŋakwo. We anà mbuur afàpà la anà afàtsul mbar. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään: isàkal naa mbuur kan'kaar ndaa amɛ, nde usàkwà anki akà ikikye. »<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Apan, Ayudà nsil abà bàtɛn a nde naa: « Apanà, bi kan'yöb naa ngye awe anà unsɔŋà! Abàlam kàkyàkwà anà aŋangɔɔm sye, wɛ ngye atɛn naa: "Isàkal naa mbuur an'kaar ndaa amɛ, nde usàkwà anki akà ikikye." <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Nkye ngye, ngye an'söön taaràbi Abàlam awà kàkü itaan? Aŋangɔɔm sye bàkyàkwà! Ngye, ngye akasii naa ngye awà nà? » <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ, mɛ in'fàsà làkoo akà mɛ ŋakwo, la ndöŋ latɛy. Mɛ, mɛ in'fàsà làkoo a Taaràmɛ, nde akwà làfàtɛn bɛ naa: "Nde wà Nzam abi". <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Bɛ nde lun'yöb anki, wɛɛ akà mɛ, mɛ in'kyun'yöb. Kya mɛ in'sàtɛn naa mɛ un'yöb anki, mɛ in'sàkal mbuur a loor asànaa bɛ. Mɛ in'kyun'yöb anà mɛ sye in'fàkaar ndaa ande. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Taaràbɛ Abàlam kàkäl kà un'sak unsà an'kyän muman ilä amɛ: nde kàkyàman kya, waa kàkü unsà un'sak. » <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayudà waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Nkye ngye akà mbul an'kwem an'tyeen awe ayà, waa ngye kàmɛn Abàlam! » <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yɛsu naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään: kusà a mböör a Abàlam, "Mɛ In'wà". » <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Apan, ba b 1 bür in'kul ntɔn mukun'kam. Wɛɛ Yɛsu laa kàkàyee nde, waa kàtoo u ndwà a Nzam.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr ikwàmii fà mböör ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>U mbwo, Yɛsu kàmɛn baal mwɛy wàŋàkwàmii fà mböör ande. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Alɔŋki ande bun'fuul naa: « Rabi, nà kàkyer man'be ntɔn nde bun'bör wàŋàkwàmii, nkye nde lɛɛ aböör ande? » <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Kà nde anki, itàkal aböör ande, wɛɛ ntɔn isal a Nzam imɛnà amu nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Ibà bi pà u mwäänà, bi ikyer isal a mbuur kan'töm. Làpib làmubwà, taaŋ mpa usal mbuur. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Umpal in'wà mɛ pà u mɛɛn, mɛ in'wà pɛɛlà a mɛɛn. » <verse eid="JHN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Ungö mutɛn indiir abi, nde kàtsül an'te u mɛɛn, kàkyer twar, waa kàkiir la u mii a ikwamii, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Kyen, kaywɛb kà itɛy a Silɔwɛ. » Ikɔb aki ikaswaŋà naa « Ntööm ». Ikwàmii kàkyen kwo, kàywɛy ntabwey, waa kàyimanà mpal kàyàfurà nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Baar a tsütsü anà nde anà baar bàfun'manà kusà wàmulɔlɔm, bàfuulà naa: « Nkye wà kà mbuur akwà kàkälà wà aŋàbwaay anà kàfalɔ̈lɔ̈mà anki? » <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Amwɛy bàtɛɛnà naa: « Awà nde. » Bumwɛy naa: « Awà kà nde anki, mbuur asin kàmufwän. » Wɛɛ ikwàmii kàkyey naa: « Ndandaa, wà mɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Abun, ba bun'fuulà naa: « Mii angye myan'dubà aben? » <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Nde kàfuur naa: « Mbuur awà bàfàbel Yɛsu kàkyer twar, kan'kiir la u mii, waa kàtɛn a mɛ naa: "Kyen Silɔwɛ, kaywɛb". Apan sye in'kyen mɛ, in'ywɛb mɛ, waa in'bulà muman! » <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Ba bun'fuul naa: « Nde wàken, mbuur wa? » Nde kàfuur naa: « Mɛ in'yöb anki. »<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amfarisi ban'fuul ikwamii awà kàkɔɔrà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Apan, ba bàtwääl mbuur kàkäl ikwàmii akà Amfarisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Kyekà, ilä akin kyàkäl ilä a saba akyà kàkyer Yɛsu twar, anà kun'duub nde mii. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Apan sye, Amfarisi bun'fuul sye naa mii angye myàdubà aben. Nde kafuur naa: « Nde kan'kiir twar u mii, in'ywɛb mɛ, waa mɛ an'man. » <verse eid="JHN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Apan, uboo a Amfarisi amwɛy bàtɛɛnà naa: « Mbuur awà kà kan'fà akà Nzam anki, ntɔn nde saba ufàkyɛɛl anki. » Wɛɛ bumwɛy bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nkye mbuur a man'be kan'kwo ukäl anà ikɔ̈b akyer idiim a tub abi? » Nkaabà yàkyer abilà uboo a ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Apan, ba bàfàfuul ikwamii naa: « Waa ngye, ngye an'tɛn aben ntɔn mbuur kaduub mii? » Nde kàfuur naa: « Nde wà ŋangɔɔm. »<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Wɛɛ amfum a Ayudà bàkyer atɔn musà làkwikilà naa nde kàkäl ikwàmii, waa nde kàbulà muman. Undiir awun, bàbel ba aböör ande <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>ntɔn mukafuul naa: « Nkye wà mwan abɛ akwà làwe bɛ naa nde bun'bör wàŋàkwàmii? Abun, nde kan'man aben apanà? » <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Aböör ande bàfuur naa: « Bi, bi ikyàyöb ndandaa naa wà mwan baal abi, nde sye bun'bör wàŋàkwàmii. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Apanà nde kan'man aben, bi iyöb anki. Nà kun'duub mii? Bi iyöb anki. Lun'fuul, nde wàŋàyɛl, nde kan'kwo musam ntɔn nde ŋakwo! » <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Aböör ande bàtɛɛnà ba abà, ntɔn ba bàtiinà Ayudà bɔɔmà. Ntɔn amfum a Ayudà bàdirà kusà muböŋ u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà mbuur wanswà asàkyey naa Yɛsu wà Klistɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Undiir awun aböör ande bàtɛn ba naa: « Nde wàŋàyɛl, lun'fuul! »<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Amfarisi bàbel mbuur akwà kàkäl aŋàkwàmii mbalà yàyweel, waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Pà làkoo akà Nzam! Bi, bi ikyàyöb naa baal wà wà mbuur a man'be. » <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Nde kafuur naa: « Isàkal naa nde wà mbuur a man'be, mɛ in'yöb anki. Mɛ in'yöb undiir mwɛy mpɛl awà: mɛ kàkäl ikwàmii, apanà mɛ an'man. » <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Ba waa bun'fuul naa: « Ininà nde kakyer? Nde ngye mii kaduub aben? » <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Nde kafuur naa: « Mɛ ya akyàlakyään itaan, wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làwem anki. Ntɔn nkye làkwen bɛ mufàwem mbalà asin? Nkye bɛ sye, bɛ làkwen mubulà alɔŋki ande? » <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Apan, ba waa bàsɛmà mukun'to, mutɛn naa: « Ngye mbuur awà un'lɔŋki ande! Bi, bi ibà alɔŋki a Mɔsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Bi, bi ikyàyöb naa Nzam kàyääm a Mɔsɛ, wɛɛ mbuur wà, bi iyöb anki naa nde an'fà ken! » <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Baal kafuur naa: « Le, ayi ndaa yubem: bɛ làyöb anki naa nde kan'fà ken, apan sye nde kàman'duub mii! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Bi ikyàyöb naa Nzam ufàwem anki baar a man'be. Wɛɛ isàkal naa mbuur afàkömà Nzam anà afàkyer ukwen ande, Nzam afàkyer un'wem. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Baar ŋàtàwem anki akà ikikye mutɛn naa mbuur mwɛy waa kàkɔɔr ikwàmii fà mböör ande. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ilàkal naa mbuur awà kàfü anki akà Nzam, nde kàlàkwo anki mukyer akà undiir. » <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Ngye wanswà awà uboo a man'be fà mböör angye, waa ngye ilɔŋ! » Apan ba waa bun'tɔɔm u nsà.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikwàmii a dweelà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yɛsu kàwem naa ba nde bàkyer un'böŋ. Mpal kàbwey nde anà nde, nde kun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye, ngye an'sà làkwikilà amu mwan a mbuur? » – <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Nde kun'fuur naa: « Mwol, nde wà nà, waa mɛ in'sà làkwikilà amu nde? » <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye amun'man, wa atɛɛnà awà apanà anà ngye, nde awà. » <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Baal waa kàtɛn naa: « Mwol, mɛ, mɛ an'sà làkwikilà. » Apan, nde kàbü an'köm kusà a Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Waa Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ, mɛ kàyi u mɛɛn pà ntɔn ntsüül a nsaŋ mwɛy ikäl: ntɔn ikwàmii bàmɛn, baar bàfàman bàbulà ikwàmii. » <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Amfarisi bàkäl tsütsü apà nde, bàwem ba indiir abi, waa bun'fuul naa: « Nkye bi sye, bi ibà ikwàmii? » <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Yàlàkal naa bɛ làbà ikwàmii, bɛ làlàkal anki baar a man'be. Wɛɛ ntɔn bɛ làtɛn naa: "Bi ifàman", abun, man'be abɛ mà kapaa. »<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a un'kyɛɛŋ anà in'kɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään: isàkal naa mbuur ubilà anki u munàmbwo a làböl a in'kɔk, wɛɛ naa nde kan'lar udu a ibä a làböl, u ntsü yumwɛy, nde wà mbüüb anà un'dwää. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Wɛɛ mbuur afàbilà u munàmbwo, nde wun'kyɛɛŋ a in'kɔk. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Un'leer kun'duub munàmbwo, in'kɔk myàwem ndaa ande. Nde afàbel in'kɔk ande umwɛy umwɛy kà ikɔb awa, waa utwey mya u nsà. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Utaaŋ utwey nde mya myanswà, uyikyà nde kusà a mya, mya myun'lab ungö, ntɔn mya myàkyàyöb ndaa ande. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Ikwe anki akà ikikye naa mya myàsàlab ungyey, mya ikyer asun'tiin, ntɔn mya myàyöb anki ndaa a angyey. »<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yɛsu katɛɛl nsim ayi, wɛɛ ba bàyöb anki naa indiir nà nde kàtɛɛnà.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu, un'kyɛɛŋ a in'kɔk aŋàbwaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, mɛ in'wà munàmbwo a làböl a in'kɔk. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Baar banswà bàfwel kusà a mɛ bà mbüüb anà adwää, wɛɛ in'kɔk myawem anki. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'wà munàmbwo. Isàkal naa mbuur kan'bilà u mbwo amɛ, nde asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈, nde akyer asàbilà, akyer asàtoo, nde asàman byàdyà. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Mbüüb afàyà nà muyib, mudwa anà mupay. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ kàyi ntɔn baar bàwɛl mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà bàwɛl wa mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'wà un'kyɛɛŋ aŋàbwaŋ. Un'kyɛɛŋ aŋàbwaŋ afàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ntɔn in'kɔk ande. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Mbuur afàsal ntɔn ngim mpɛl, nde kà wà un'kyɛɛŋ a ndandaa anki, in'kɔk kà myànde anki. Kya nde usàman kyɛŋbɔl làmuyà, nde la usàkɔɔb nde in'kɔk, waa uwurà ntiin. Apan, kyɛŋbɔl la làsàbürà la mya, waa làsàtà làböl upay. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Le, nde wà un'syääl a ngim, nde undiir ukyɛr anki ntɔn in'kɔk. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'wà un'kyɛɛŋ aŋàbwaŋ. Mɛ in'kyàyöb in'kɔk amɛ, mya sye myàkyan'yöb, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Taaràmɛ akyan'yöb, mɛ sye in'kyun'yöb. Mɛ in'fàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ ntɔn in'kɔk amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'we anà in'kɔk myumwɛy mpa amyà uboo a làböl alà. Mya sye mɛ in'kyer atwaal. Mya isàwem ndaa amɛ, làböl làsàkal làmwɛy, un'kyɛɛŋ mwɛy sye. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Taa akyan'kwen, ntɔn mɛ in'fàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ, ungö waa in'fàwal wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy tɛy afan'duum mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ wa in'fàpà a ukwen amɛ. Mɛ in'we anà ikɔ̈b apà wa, anà ikɔ̈b afàwal wa. Ayi nswɛɛŋ kan'pɛ Taaràmɛ. »<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>U ndaa ayi, nkaabà yàkyer abilà uboo a amfum a Ayudà. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Bàmbɔɔn uboo a ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde we anà unsɔŋà! Nde wà ŋukɔŋ! Ntɔn nkye lun'weemà bɛ? » <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Wɛɛ bumwɛy bàtɛɛnà naa: « Mbuur awe anà unsɔŋà ufàtɛn anki abà. Nkye unsɔŋà kan'kwo muduub mii a ikwàmii? »<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmutɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>La làkäl paŋà làfakalà mpye mbɔɔn, baar bàkäl mukyɔm mpööŋ a ndwà a Nzam u Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yɛsu kàkäl mulàlyaaŋ u ndwà a Nzam, u myäy bàfàbel naa myäy a Salɔmun. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Apan, Amfum a Ayudà bàkyer un'diŋà, waa bun'fuul naa: « Tii mpal nà asikaar ngye unsà pfürà? Ikyään ubwaŋàbwaŋ isàkal naa ngye awà Klistɔ. » <verse eid="JHN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Mɛ ya akyàlakyään itaan, wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ lan'si anki làkwikilà. Isal in'fàkyer mɛ kà ikɔb a Taaràmɛ, byàmutà imbäl ntɔn mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Wɛɛ bɛ lan'si anki làkwikilà, ntɔn bɛ kàlàbà in'kɔk amɛ anki. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>In'kɔk amɛ myàfàwem ndaa amɛ. Mɛ in'kyayöb, mya sye myàkyer afan'lab. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Mɛ in'fapà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye, mya myàsàkyà anki bwà akà ikikye, akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mugyɔɔr mya u kɔɔ amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Taaràmɛ, mbuur kan'pɛ mya, kan'söön baar banswà. Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mugyɔɔr mya u kɔɔ a Taa. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Taa anà mɛ, bi ibà mwɛy. »<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ayudà bàfàbürà in'kul ntɔn mukun'tà. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ kàlamɛɛy isal a ntwɛn mbɔɔn byàfü akà Taa. Isal nà uboo a bya làkwen bɛ mukan'tà in'kul? » <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayudà bun'fuur naa: « Kà ntɔn isal a ntwɛn anki waa bi katà in'kul, wɛɛ ntɔn mbɛɛy: ngye awà mbuur, wɛɛ ngye, ngye awàmukyey naa ngye awà Nzam! » <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Nkye bàsön anki uboo a un'kɔɔn abɛ naa: "Mɛ, mɛ kàtɛn naa bɛ làbà bànzam."? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Bi ikyàyöb naa ikwe anki bàlwom indiir abyà uboo a Ndaa Aŋàsɔn. Kyekà, Nzam kàbel nde baar naa bànzam, ntɔn ndaa ande bàtöm akà ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Bɛ, bɛ làtɛn a baal kàsi Nzam an'kɔɔ anà kàtöm nde u mɛɛn naa: "Ngye awàmubɛy!", ntɔn an'tɛn mɛ naa mɛ in'wà Mwan a Nzam! <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Isàkal naa mɛ in'fàkyer anki isal a Taaràmɛ, twon làman'sà làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa mɛ in'fàkyer bya, itàkal naa bɛ lan'sà anki làkwikilà, làsi làkwikilà unsà isal abi. Ntɔn bɛ làyöb anà làkyey naa Taa wà amu mɛ, mɛ in'wà amu Taa. » <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Apan, ba bàfàleŋ mukun'kɔr, wɛɛ nde kàkwiyà kà an'kɔɔ aba. <verse eid="JHN 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yɛsu kàfàfurà sim a Yɔrdan lumwɛy, kà ikal kàfadümà Ywan utàtwɛb, waa kàbwaay kwo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Baar mbɔɔn bàyee akà nde, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Ywan kàkyer anki akà idiim mwɛy, wɛɛ ndaa yanswà kàtɛn nde ntɔn mbuur awà yàkäl ndandaa. » <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Abun, baar mbɔɔn bàsi làkwikilà amu nde.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkweel a Lazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Kàkäl anà ŋukyal mwɛy ikɔb ande Lazar, un'si Bɛtanya, bul a Màlatà anà mpääŋ ande Màlye. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>- Wawà Màlye akwà kàtsüül Mwol may a usɔŋ anà kun'kɔɔm in'kɔl a ntswe ande. Baal ande Lazar kàkäl anà ukyal. - <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Abun, ampääŋ abà bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàtöm mbuur mwɛy mukàkyään Yɛsu naa: « Mwol, mbuur akwà afàkwen ngye we anà ukyal. » <verse eid="JHN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Umpal kàwem Yɛsu làsaŋ alà, nde kàtɛn naa: « Abà kà ukyal akun'syen kà ukwà anki, wɛɛ ba bà ntɔn mupà làkoo akà Nzam: u mbwo a ba, Mwan a Nzam ayàwal làkoo. »<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Kyekà, Yɛsu kàfakwenà Màlatà, anà mpääŋ ande, anà Lazar. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Umpal kàwem nde naa Lazar we anà ukyal, nde kàfàkyer ilä byeel kà ikal kàkäl nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Ungö apan nde kàtɛn a alɔŋki naa: « Tsweenà ifurà Yuday. » <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Alɔŋki bun'fuur naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy, amfum a Ayudà bàleŋà mukatà in'kul, waa ngye akwen mufàfurà kwo? » <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Nkye an'taaŋ kwem aŋiyweel matɛy u mwäänà? Isàkal naa mbuur wàmuyikyà u mwäänà, nde uböl anki kyà, ntɔn lye anà pɛɛlà. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa mbuur wàmuyikyà u làpib, nde atɛbà kyà, ntɔn pɛɛlà latɛy. » <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Ungö kàtɛn nde ndaa ayi, nde kàkwɛy naa: « Un'sam abi Lazar kàn'bɔ̈ɔ̈n, wɛɛ mɛ in'kyer akyà mukun'wiiy. » <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Apan, alɔŋki bàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, isàkal naa nde wàŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n, nde akyer ayàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈. » <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ, Yɛsu kàsam ukwà a Lazar, wɛɛ ba bàsii naa twaal a twaal. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa: « Lazar kan'kwà. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Mɛ in'wà unsà un'sak ntɔn bɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n akal mɛ kwo, ntɔn bɛ lan'si làkwikilà. Wɛɛ tsweenà akà nde. » <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Apan, Tuma awà bàfàbel naa Didimɔ, kàtɛn a alɔŋki bumwɛy naa: « Tsweenà, kya ikäl naa ukwà, bi sye ikàkwà mbwo mwɛy anà nde! »<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wà ngwiiy anà mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Mpal kàyàkɔlà Yɛsu, nde kàwem naa Lazar kàkyàkyer ilä inà kà an'dii. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Kyekà, Bɛtanya làkäl tsütsü a Yɛlusàlɛm, kà isii a an'kilɔmɛtre an'tär. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Ayudà bàyi mbɔɔn muyàlɛɛl Màlye anà Màlatà ntɔn nkweel a baal aba Lazar. <verse eid="JHN 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Umpal kàwem Màlatà naa Yɛsu wàmuyà, nde kàkàbwey anà nde, wɛɛ Màlye kàsàsal u ndwà wàŋàbwaay. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Màlatà kàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Mwol, ilàkal naa ngye akäl apà, baal amɛ kàlàkwà anki! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'kyàyöb, itàkal apanà, naa undiir wanswà ayàlɔm ngye akà Nzam, Nzam akyer ayapà. » <verse eid="JHN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Baal angye akyer ayàwiyà. » <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Màlatà kàfuur naa: « Mɛ in'kyàyöb naa nde asàkyer awiyà mbwo mwɛy a akü, kà ilä a ntsüü. » <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà ngwiiyà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Mbuur wanswà an'sà làkwikilà amu mɛ asàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, itàkal naa nde kan'kwà. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Mbuur wanswà awe anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà an'sà làkwikilà amu mɛ, nde usàkwà anki akà ikikye. Nkye ngye an'sà làkwikilà? » - <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Nde kàfuur naa: « Inye, Mwol, mɛ an'sà làkwikilà naa ngye awà Klistɔ, Mwan a Nzam awasàyà pà u mɛɛn. »<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà ampääŋ a Lazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Apan, Màlatà kàkàbel mpääŋ ande Màlye, waa kun'kyään unsinsi naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ kan'yà, nde sye wàmukabeelà. » <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Pa kàwem Màlye abà, laa kàmbarà nde, kàkyen u ntiin akà Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Kyekà, Yɛsu kàkäl anki aŋàtàbilà uboo a bul, wɛɛ nde kàtàfàkal kà ikal kàkun'taan Màlatà. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Ayudà bàkäl anà Màlye u ndwà ntɔn mukun'lɛɛl, mpal bun'mɛn ba kan'barà anà kan'too u ntiin, laa bun'läb ba. Ntɔn ba bàsii naa nde wàmukyà an'dii mukàlel. <verse eid="JHN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Umpal kàkɔlà Màlye kà ikal kàkäl Yɛsu, pa kun'mɛn nde, nde kàbü kà in'kɔl ande, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, ilàkal naa ngye akäl apà, baal amɛ kàlàkwà anki. » <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Utaaŋ kàmɛn Yɛsu Màlatà anà Ayudà bàkäl anà nde bàmulel, mpem ande yàkyer atɛɛr, lingyoomà làkyer un'wal. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Nde waa kafuul naa: « Wa bɛ lun'tɔ̈ɔ̈l ken? » Ba bun'fuur naa: « Mwol, yamɛn. » <verse eid="JHN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yɛsu waa kàlel. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Abun, Ayudà bàtɛɛnà naa: « Làler naa nde kàfun'kwenà aben! » <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Wɛɛ amwɛy uboo a ba bàtɛn naa: « Nde mbuur kàkɔɔr ikwàmii, nkye nde kàlàkyer anki sye naa Lazar ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akwà? »<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazar kan'furà u mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàfàtɛɛr u mpem ande, waa kàkyen an'dii, ma màkäl mɔɔ aŋàdübà a nkɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Làlwom nkɔŋ yi. » Màlatà, mpääŋ a un'kü, kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, apanà nde ayàkal aŋàfuurà nsɔŋ, ntɔn ŋàbà ilä inà awà nde apà. » <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Nkye mɛ in'tɛn anki a ngye naa isàkal naa ngye awe anà làkwikilà, ngye ayàman làkoo a Nzam? » <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Abun, ba waa bàlwom nkɔŋ. Apan, Yɛsu kàler u du, waa kàtɛn naa: « Taa, mɛ amafuur an'tɔɔn ntɔn aman'wem ngye. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ndandaa, mɛ in'kyàyöb naa ngye afàkyer an'wem taaŋ lanswà. Wɛɛ an'tɛn mɛ abà, ntɔn baar bàman'diŋà bà bàyöb naa ngye kan'töm. » <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Ungö mutɛn abà, nde kàbel u ndaa a ngwal naa: « Lazar, yatoo! » <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Un'kü sye waa kàyàtoo, in'kɔl anà an'kɔɔ myàŋàlàlal a ikaam a ipfɛy anà ntabwey yàŋàfwe a ipfɛy. Yɛsu kàtɛn a baar naa: « Lun'tsuuŋ, lun'wɛy ukyen. »<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndiirà ntɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Màt 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Apan, bàmbɔɔn uboo a Ayudà bàyi akà Màlye anà bàmɛn indiir kàkyer Yɛsu, ba bun'si làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Wɛɛ bumwɛy bàkàman Amfarisi, waa bakyään indiir kàkyer Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Apan, amfum a angaŋ anà Amfarisi bàköŋà làbay a nsaŋ a kölàköl, waa bàtɛn naa: « Ininà bi kan'kwo mukyer? Ntɔn baal wà wàmukyer idiim mbɔɔn! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Isàkal naa bi kàmuwɛy musin akyer abà, baar banswà bàyun'sà làkwikilà. Apan, Bàlɔmà bàyàyà mupay ndwà a Nzam abi anà nsi abi! » <verse eid="JHN 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Umwɛy uboo aba, ikɔb ande Kayifa, kàkäl undweer a angaŋ u mbul awun, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ, bɛ akà undiir mwɛy làkayöbà anki! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Nkye bɛ làmanà anki naa yubwaŋ naa mbuur mwɛy ukü ntɔn un'sɛŋ, waa nsi yanswà mpa ikyà bwà? » <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Kyekà, nde kàtɛɛnà anki abà unsà ukwen ande ŋakwo, wɛɛ ntɔn kàkäl nde undweer a ngaŋ u mbul awun, nde kàtɛɛ ngɔɔm naa Yɛsu akyer asàkwà ntɔn un'sɛŋ ande, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>kànà ntɔn un'sɛŋ mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye ntɔn mutüüb baan a Nzam abà bàtɛ upay.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Fà ilä akin, amfum a Ayudà bàtsül mbar naa bàdwa Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Undiir awun, Yɛsu mpa kàfàfilyaaŋà nde kà imɛɛy u mii a amfum a Ayudà: nde kàkyen u mpey, kà itiir a nsi mwɛy tsütsü a nsye a ipɔl, u bul mwɛy ikɔb a la Ɛfalayimi, waa kàbwaay kwo anà alɔŋki ande.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Un'kyɔm a Pak a Ayudà kàkäl tsütsü. Baar mbɔɔn bàfwee kà itiir a nsi aki bàbeenà Yɛlusàlɛm kusà a un'kyɔm mukwo, ntɔn mukàpöŋ ndür. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Ba bàkäl muleŋà Yɛsu, wɛɛ umpal bàkäl ba u Ndwà a Nzam, ba bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Bɛ làsii aben? Nkye nde uyà anki un'kyɔm? » <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Kyekà, andweer a angaŋ anà Amfarisi bàpɛ nswɛɛŋ naa: isàkal naa mbuur kan'yöb ikal awà nde, nde kakyään ntɔn ba bun'kör.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Màlye kan'kiir in'kɔl a Yɛsu may a usɔŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Màt 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Ilä isyaam kusà a Pak mukwo, Yɛsu kàkyen Bɛtanya, kà ikal kàfakalà Lazar akwà kàwiiy nde uboo a akü. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Akun, Màlatà kun'pɛ isaa bun'lääm ba. Lazar kàkäl umwɛy uboo a baar bàkäl mbwo mwɛy anà Yɛsu mudyà u mɛsà. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Màlye kàwɛl boboo a litre mwɛy là may a usɔŋ màndandaa, màntal a mbɔɔn, nde kàsir ma kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu. Ungö waa kàkɔɔmà ma a ntswe ande. Apan, ndwà yanswà yàtiimà a usɔŋ a may. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Ungö apan, Yudasi Isikalyɔt - umwɛy uboo a alɔŋki ande, nde mbuur awayun'yälà, - kàtɛn naa: <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>« Ntɔn nkye mpa bàyälà ba may a usɔŋ amà unsà nkam tär yà itɛr a ngim, waa bàlàpà ya akà aŋàlàmbwà? » <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Kàtɛɛnà nde abà, kà ntɔn nde kàkäl anà ngyɛb a aŋàlàmbwà anki, wɛɛ ntɔn nde kàkäl mbüüb: nde kàfakaarà bɔ̈ɔ̈n a ngim, waa kàfalwabà ngim bàsyee uboo mwo. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Un'si a duu! Kan'kyer nde abà, nde kan'tsweel kusà ntɔn ilä bàsan'dye. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Bɛ làwe anà aŋàlàmbwà ilä byanswà, wɛɛ mɛ, bɛ làbye anki anà mɛ ilä byanswà. »<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndiirà ntɔn Lazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Apan, un'sɛŋ a Ayudà mbɔɔn kàwem wa naa Yɛsu kàkäl u Bɛtanya, wa kàkyeenà kwo, kà nà ntɔn Yɛsu mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye ntɔn mukàman Lazar akwà kàwiiy nde uboo a akü. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Apan, andweer a angaŋ bàdirà mudwa Lazar sye, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>ntɔn Ayudà mbɔɔn bàtiinà Ikööŋ aba, waa bàsyee làkwikilà akà Yɛsu isin nà Lazar.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'bilà u Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Màt 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>U taaŋtye, iköŋ a baar mbɔɔn akwà bàyi un'kyɔm a Pak, kyàwem naa Yɛsu wàmuyàbeenà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Ba bàwɛl an'laaŋ a an'bà, bàkyen mukàbwey anà nde, bàmuyisà in'kwɛŋ naa: « Ɔsana! Wɛy ukäl aŋàsaak mbuur awà ayà kà ikɔb a Mwol, Mfum a Isàlɛl. » <verse eid="JHN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yɛsu kàmɛn mwan a anɛ, waa kàbwaay udu a wa, asànaa ikyäänà Ndaa Aŋàsɔn naa:<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>« Bul a Siyɔn, twon an'man bɔɔmà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Le, Mfum angye wàmuyà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">akyàbwaay udu a mwan a anɛ. »<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>U nsɛmà, alɔŋki ande bàkayöbà anki indiir abi. Wɛɛ umpal kàwɛl Yɛsu làkoo, apan ba bàyɔbà naa indiir abi bàsön ntɔn nde anà ba bya sye bàkyer ntɔn nde.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Baar banswà bàkäl anà Yɛsu mpal kàbel nde Lazar muyàtoo kà an'dii anà kun'wiiy nde uboo a akü, bun'tɛɛlà imbäl. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Kyakin, iköŋ a baar kyàkàbwey kya anà nde, ntɔn kya kyàwem naa nde kàkyer impà akin. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Apan, Amfarisi bàtɛn ba a ba naa: « Bɛ lan'man naa bɛ akà undiir làyàwal anki: le, baar banswà bàmun'lab! »<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angɛlɛki amwɛy bàmuleŋ Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Yàmɛnà naa uboo a baar bàbeenà Yɛlusàlɛm mukömà umpal a un'kyɔm, bàkäl anà Angɛlɛki amwɛy. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Ba bàsin apà Filipo, un'nsi Bɛtesayidà a Ngalilɛ, waa bun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi ikwen muman Yɛsu. » <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipo kàkàsam Andrɛ, ungö, ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l waa bàkàsam Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Mpalabà taaŋ lan'kwo alà uwal Mwan a mbuur làkoo. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään, isàkal naa imbɛŋ a blɛ kyan'bwà u mɛɛn ikü anki, kya ikal kya mpɛl aŋàyen. Wɛɛ, isàkal naa kya kyan'kwà, kya ibɔr mbɛŋ mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Mbuur akwen mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande aŋàsɔ̈ɔ̈n Nzam, wa akyà bwà, wɛɛ mbuur asàkɔɔb mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande u mɛɛn pà, nde asàkaar wa mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kan'kwen mukan'syääl, wɛy nde kan'läb. Ikal in'wà mɛ, un'syääl amɛ asàkal kwo sye. Isàkal naa mbuur kàman'syääl, Taa asun'pà làkoo.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'sam nkweel ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>« Papanà mpem amɛ yan'too! Waa ininà mɛ in'tɛn? Taa, ntsü mɔ̈ɔ̈ utaaŋ alà? Wɛɛ kiin amɛ, mɛ kàyi ntɔn taaŋ a mpay a tub alà! <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Taa, pà ikɔb angye làkoo! » Apan, ndaa yàfü du, yàtɛn naa: « Mɛ kàkyàpà kya làkoo, mɛ in'kyer ayàfàpà kya làkoo. » <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Iköŋ a baar kyàkäl pa anà kyàwem ndaa, kyàtɛɛnà naa: « Ipar kyan'bwà! » Bumwɛy naa: « Un'kyeey mwɛy kàmusam! » <verse eid="JHN 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yɛsu kakyään naa: « Ndaa ayi kà ban'tɛn a mɛ anki, wɛɛ ban'tɛn a bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Papanà là taaŋ mutsul nsaŋ a mɛɛn mà, papanà mfum a mɛɛn mà bàyun'tɔɔm u nsà. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Wɛɛ akà mɛ, mpal bàsan'sɛɛn u mɛɛn pà, mɛ in'sànaan baar banswà akà mɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Kàtɛɛnà nde abà, nde kàswɛŋà naa nkweel ande isàkal aben. <verse eid="JHN 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Iköŋ a baar kyun'fuur naa: « Bi, bi kàlɔŋàkà unsà Un'kɔɔn naa Klistɔ asàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ipepey. Aben ngye an'kwo mutɛn naa Mwan a mbuur bàkyer asun'sɛɛn? Nà Mwan a mbuur awà? » <verse eid="JHN 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Pɛɛlà làfàkal anki anà taaŋ mbɔɔn uboo a bɛ. Làlyaaŋ umpal làbà bɛ anà pɛɛlà, ntɔn mpib ikɔ̈ɔ̈n alabweel. Ntɔn mbuur afilyaaŋ u mpib, nde uyöb anki naa nde akyà ken. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Kyakin, mpal làbà bɛ anà pɛɛlà, làsi làkwikilà amu pɛɛlà, ntɔn bɛ làbulà baan a pɛɛlà. »</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Ayudà ban'tɔn musà làkwikilà amu Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Ungö kàsam nde ba abà, Yɛsu kàlwomà paa, waa kàkàyee ukwɛl apà ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Itàkal naa nde kàkyerà idiim mbɔɔn u mii a ba, ba bàsun'sà anki làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Abun yàkwe ndaa kàtɛn ŋangɔɔm Yɛsay:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">« Mwol, nà kàsi làkwikilà akà an'lɔɔŋ abi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Mwol ngwal ande kàswɛŋ akà nà? »<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Yɛsay awà kàswɛŋ sye isin a ndaa mpa bàkwe ba musà làkwikilà:<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>« Nzam kàdwä mii aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">nde kàbuul mpem aba bwoor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ntɔn mii aba ikɔ̈ɔ̈n atääl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">naa mpem aba ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ayöb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ntɔn ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n asàfyefurà akà mɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ntɔn mɛ akɔɔr. »<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Yɛsay kàtɛn nde indiir abi, ntɔn kàmɛn nde làkoo a Yɛsu, waa kàsam ntɔn nde.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Apanà sye, bàmbɔɔn uboo a amfum a Ayudà ŋakwo bàsi làkwikilà amu nde. Wɛɛ, ntɔn Amfarisi, ba bàkyey anki u mii a baar manà bàyatwey u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Ntɔn ba bàkwen làkoo lan'fà akà baar, akwànaa lan'fà akà Nzam.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsaŋ ntɔn ndaa a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yɛsu kàsi un'kwɛŋ: « Mbuur asà làkwikilà amu mɛ, kà amu mɛ mpɛl anki nde kan'sà làkwikilà, wɛɛ amu mbuur kan'töm sye. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Mbuur aman'man, nde kan'man sye mbuur kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Mɛ pɛɛlà, mɛ kàyi u mɛɛn, ntɔn mbuur wanswà asà làkwikilà amu mɛ, ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal uboo a mpib. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kan'wem ndaa amɛ, wɛ nde ya ufàsyääl anki, kà mɛ anki in'sàtsul nsaŋ ande, ntɔn mɛ kàyi anki mutsul nsaŋ a mɛɛn, wɛɛ ntɔn mukun'tswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Mbuur atɔn mɛ anà akɔ̈ɔ̈n akyey ndaa amɛ, nde we anà un'tsüül a nsaŋ ande: an'lɔɔŋ kàpɛɛ mɛ isun'tsüül mbar kà ilä a ntsüü. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Ntɔn mɛ kàtɛn anki unsà ukwen amɛ ŋakwo, wɛɛ Taa, mbuur kan'töm, kan'swɛŋ nde ŋakwo naa ininà mɛ in'tɛn, ininà mɛ in'kyään. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Waa mɛ in'kyàyöb naa nswɛɛŋ ande ifàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. Kyakin indiir an'tɛn mɛ, mɛ bya an'tɛn asànaa kan'swɛŋ Taa. »<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'ywɛy in'kɔl a alɔŋki ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa kusà a un'kyɔm a Pak, Yɛsu kàkyer ayöb naa taaŋ ande lan'kwo, taaŋ ntɔn mulwomà u mɛɛn pà anà mukyà akà Taa. Nde kàkwen bànde abà u mɛɛn pà, nde kakwen aŋàsöönà. <verse eid="JHN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Kyekà, umpal bàkäl ba mudyà làsisye, ileŋ kàkyàbiil itaan an'kyän u mpem a Yudasi, mwan a Simɔn Isikalyɔt, ntɔn mukun'yälà. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yɛsu kàyöbà naa indiir byanswà Taa kàpɛ kà an'kɔɔ ande, naa nde kàtoo amu Nzam, nde wàmufurà akà Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Yɛsu kàmbarà u mɛsà, kàlwom ipfey adu ande, waa kàwɛl làpye, kàbäm la u lɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Ungö, nde kàsi an'dà u làlɔŋà, waa kàsɛmà muywɛy in'kɔl a alɔŋki ande, waa kàkɔɔmà mya a làpye kàbäm nde u lɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Apan, kan'yàtol nde akà Simɔn Petɔlà, nde waa utɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, ngye, an'ywɛy in'kɔl! » <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Undiir in'kyer mɛ wà, ngye wa ayöb anki apanà, wɛɛ ngye wa asàyöb ungö. » <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Petɔlà kàtɛn a nde naa: « Aay, ngye mɛ in'kɔl an'ywɛy anki akà ikikye! » Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ mya aywɛy anki, ngye un'tüüb anà mɛ watɛy. » <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, isàkal abwɛy, twon aman'ywɛy nà in'kɔl mpɛl, wɛɛ anà an'kɔɔ anà un'tswe sye! » <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mbuur aŋàywab, nde mfun afàywab yatɛy, ntɔn ndür ande yanswà yàŋàpɔŋà. Bɛ, bɛ làbà aŋàpɔŋà, wɛɛ kà bɛ banswà anki. » <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Nde kàkyer ayöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa nà kàlun'yälà, undiir awun kàtɛn nde naa: « Kà bɛ banswà anki làbà aŋàpɔŋà. »<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Ungö kaywɛy nde in'kɔl, Yɛsu kàfàbwaar ipfɛy adu ande, nde kàfurà u mɛsà, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye bɛ lan'yöb undiir amàlakyer mɛ? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Bɛ, bɛ làfan'bel "Un'lɔɔŋ" anà "Mwol", bɛ làbye anà iböŋ, ntɔn mɛ in'wà nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Abun, isàkal naa mɛ Mwol anà Un'lɔɔŋ, mɛ amàlaywɛy in'kɔl, wɛy bɛ, bɛ sye làywɛy in'kɔl bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Mɛ amàlapà mbaan, ntɔn bɛ sye làkyer asànaa amàlakyer mɛ là. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään: un'syääl ukwe anki ulyaaŋ nkum ande, itàkal naa ntööm ulyaaŋ mbuur kun'töm. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Isàkal naa bɛ lan'yöb indiir abi, bɛ làbà aŋun'sak isàkal naa bɛ lan'syääl bya. <verse eid="JHN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'tɛn anki ntɔn bɛ banswà, ntɔn mɛ in'kyàyöb baar kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l mɛ. Wɛɛ, wɛy Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ikwe: "Mbuur kàdyee làmpà anà mɛ, kàman'diŋà làkɔl mbaar." <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Apanà, mɛ amàlakyään kusà a ndaa ayi muyà, ntɔn, umpal iyàyà ya, waa bɛ làyàsà làkwikilà naa "Mɛ In'wà". <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàsam: mbuur wanswà awal mbuur an'tɔm mɛ, nde kàman'wal sye. Mbuur kàman'wal, nde kan'wal sye mbuur kan'töm. »<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyälà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Màt 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mlk 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Ungö mutɛn indiir abi, mpem a Yɛsu kàkyer ayɔɔ, waa kàtɛ imbäl ki: « Ndandaa, ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, umwɛy uboo abɛ akyer ayan'yälà. » <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Apan, alɔŋki bàleerà ba a ba u mii, ukɔɔn ayöb naa nde atɛɛnà ntɔn nà. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Umwɛy uboo a alɔŋki, awà kàfakweenà Yɛsu, kàkäl ukɔl a nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Apan, Simɔn Petɔlà kun'bɛl imbweer: « Un'fuul, nde atɛɛnà ntɔn nà. » <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Ungö, un'lɔŋki awà kàkàyiir kà itɔl a Yɛsu, waa kun'fuul naa: « Mwol, nà wa? » <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Mbuur awà in'yàpà mɛ itiir a làmpà in'yàdümà mɛ. » Apan sye, Yɛsu kàwɛl itiir a làmpà, kàdümà kya, waa kàpɛ kya akà Yudasi, mwan a Simɔn Isikalyɔt. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Pa kàyä Yudasi itiir a mampà kya, Satanà laa kun'bilà nde. Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Yudasi, undiir awà ngye awà mukyer, kyer wa agyägyä! » <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Baar bàkäl u mɛsà bàyöb anki, akà mbuur mwɛy, naa ntɔn nkye Yɛsu kun'kyään nde abwɛy. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Bàmbɔɔn bàsii naa ntɔn bɔ̈ɔ̈n a ngim làkälà a Yudasi, undiir awun Yɛsu kun'swɛŋ nde naa nde ukyen mukàsom indiir byàkäl mfun ntɔn un'kyɔm, itàkal naa mupà an'kab akà aŋàlàmbwà. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Pa kàwɛl Yudasi itiir a làmpà, nde kàtoo agyägyä. Làpib làkäl aŋàbwà.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ akün</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Apan, ungö a ntoo a Yudasi, Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Apanà, làkoo a Mwan a mbuur lan'mɛnà, làkoo a Nzam sye lan'mɛnà amu nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>[ Isàkal naa làkoo a Nzam lan'mɛnà amu nde, ] itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy, Nzam sye asàmɛɛy làkoo a Mwan amu nde ŋakwo. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Baan amɛ, mɛ in'fàsaal anki anà taaŋ mbɔɔn mukal anà bɛ. Bɛ, bɛ làkyer asan'leŋ, asànaa kàtɛn mɛ a amfum a Ayudà: "bɛ, bɛ làkwo anki muyà u mper ayà in'kyà mɛ", mɛ in'tɛn a bɛ sye apanà. <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Mɛ amàlapà nswɛɛŋ akün: làkäl anà ukwen bɛ a bɛ. Asànaa kàlakwen mɛ, wɛy bɛ sye làkäl anà ukwen bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Isàkal naa bɛ lan'kwen bɛ a bɛ, apan, baar banswà bàsàyöb naa bɛ làbà alɔŋki amɛ. »<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään naa Petɔlà akyer asun'tɔn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Màt 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kàfuul Yɛsu naa: « Mwol, ngye ken akyà? » Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Apanà, ngye akwo anki muyà mper in'kyà mɛ, wɛɛ ngye asan'lab ungöngö. » <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Petɔlà naa: « Mwol, ntɔn nkye mpa in'kwo mɛ muyalab apanà? Mɛ, mɛ an'kyey mupà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ ntɔn ngye! » <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yɛsu naa: « Akɔɔb mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye ntɔn mɛ! Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ akyään, nkɔɔ mwɛy uyàtàkal aŋàbel anki, ayan'tɔn ngye mbalà tär. »<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wà mbwo ifàkyà akà Taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yɛsu kan'tɛn naa: « Wɛy mpem abɛ ikɔ̈ɔ̈n akyɛɛr. Làsi làkwikilà amu Nzam, làsi làkwinkilà sye amu mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>U ndwà a Taaràmɛ ikal byà mbɔɔn. Kya ilàkɔɔn akal abwɛy, mɛ in'làlakyään anki: Mɛ amàkàlalɔ̈ɔ̈n ikal. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Umpal in'sàkyà mɛ mukàlalɔ̈ɔ̈n ikal, mɛ insàfyefurà muyàlawal, ntɔn ikal in'wà mɛ, bɛ sye làkäl paa. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Mɛ, ntsü in'kyà mɛ, bɛ làkyàyöb mbwo. » <verse eid="JHN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tuma kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, bi iyöb anki mper akyà ngye. Bi ban'kwo muyöb aben mbwo a ya? » <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà mbwo, ndandaa anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Mbuur ukwo anki mukyà akà Taa ukɔɔn alyaaŋ u mbwo amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ilàkal naa bɛ lan'yöb, bɛ làlàyöb sye Taaràmɛ. Fà apanà, bɛ làmun'yöb, bɛ làmun'man. »<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipo kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, iswɛŋ Taa, waa ya ikwo akà bi. » <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Filipo, mɛ an'kal anà bɛ taaŋ mbɔɔn, wɛɛ ngye ŋàtan'yöb anki? Mbuur kàman'man, kan'man Taa. Ntɔn nkye an'tɛn ngye naa: "Iswɛŋ Taa"? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Làsi làkwikilà naa mɛ in'wà amu Taa, naa nde wà amu mɛ. Ndaa in'fàtɛn mɛ a bɛ banswà, kà mɛ ŋakwo in'fàbɔn anki, Taa awà amu mɛ afàkyer isal ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Làsi làkwikilà naa mɛ in'wà amu Taa, naa Taa wà amu mɛ. Naa tɛy, làsi làkwikilà ntɔn isal abi. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään: mbuur awe anà làkwikilà amu mɛ, nde sye, nde asàkyer isal in'fàkyer mɛ. Nde asàkyer byàŋàsöön, ntɔn mɛ in'wàmukyà akà Taa. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Undiir wanswà làsàlɔm bɛ kà ikɔb amɛ, mɛ in'kyer asàkyer wa, ntɔn Taa uwɛl làkoo amu Mwan. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Isàkal naa bɛ lan'lɔm undiir mwɛy kà ikɔb amɛ, mɛ, mɛ in'kyer asàkyer wa.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilää mutɔm Dweelà In'kyɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>« Isàkal naa bɛ làman'kwen, bɛ làsàsyääl nswɛɛŋ amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Waa mɛ, mɛ in'sàbɔɔn Taa, waa nde usàlatööm un'lɛɛl asin ntɔn nde ukäl anà bɛ ilä byanswà: <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Dweelà a ndandaa mpa ban'kwo baar a mɛɛn muwal, ntɔn ba bun'manà anki, ba bun'yöb anki. Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làkyun'yöb, ntɔn nde wà apà bɛ, anà nde asakalà amu bɛ mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>Mɛ in'sàlawɛy anki asànaa itii, mɛ in'kyer asàfyefurà akà bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Yan'saal ikikye, baar a mɛɛn bàsan'man anki, wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làkyer asan'man ntɔn mɛ in'wà wàmɔ̈ɔ̈ anà bɛ, bɛ làsàkal bàmɔ̈ɔ̈ sye. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Kà ilä akin, bɛ làsàyöb naa mɛ in'wà amu Taaràmɛ, naa bɛ làbà amu mɛ anà mɛ in'wà amu bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>« Mbuur awe anà nswɛɛŋ amɛ anà afàsyääl ya, wawun mbuur afan'kwen. Kyeka mbuur afan'kwen, Taa asàkyer un'kwen, mɛ sye in'kyer asun'kwen, waa mɛ ŋakwo in'sàmɛnà akà nde. »<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yudasi - kà Yudas mwan a Isikalyɔt anki - kun'fuul naa: « Mwol, ya yà aben naa ngye akyer asyemɛɛy akà bi, wɛɛ kà akà baar a mɛɛn mà anki? » <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Isàkal naa mbuur mwɛy kàman'kwen, nde asàkaar ndaa amɛ, Taaràmɛ akyer asun'kwen. Bi isàyà akà nde, waa isàbwaay amu nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Mbuur mpa kan'kwen, ufàkyey anki ndaa amɛ. Ndaa lan'wem bɛ yi, kàyan'fà akà mɛ anki, wɛɛ yà Taa mbuur kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>Indiir abi, mɛ bya amàlakyään utaaŋ in'wà mɛ anà bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, un'lɛɛl, usàtɔm Taa kà ikɔb amɛ, nde asàlalɔŋ indiir byanswà, waa usàlayɔɔb ndaa yanswà kàtɛn mɛ a bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>« Mɛ amàsàlawɛy duu, mɛ amàlapà duu amɛ. Mɛ la alapà anki asànaa bàfàpà baar a mɛɛn. Wɛy mpem a bɛ ikɔ̈ɔ̈n akyɛɛr, ikɔ̈ɔ̈n atɛɛr. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Bɛ làkyàwem, mɛ kàtɛn a bɛ naa: "Mɛ an'kyà anà mɛ in'kyer asàfyefurà akà bɛ". Yàlàkal naa bɛ làfàkyer an'kwen, bɛ làlàkal unsà un'sak ntɔn in'kyà mɛ akà Taa, ntɔn Taa kàman'söön. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Mɛ amàlawey indiir abi apanà, kusà a bya muyà, ntɔn umpal isàyà bya, waa bɛ làsàsà làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Mɛ in'sàfàyääm anki mbɔɔn anà bɛ, ntɔn mfum a mɛɛn mà wàmuyà. Itàkal abun, nde ikɔ̈b mwɛy kyatɛy udu a mɛ, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>wɛɛ, ntɔn naa mɛɛn màyöb naa mɛ in'kwen Taa, anà mɛ in'fàkyer nswɛɛŋ kan'pɛ Taa. Làmbarà, tsweenà!<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu, un'te a vin a ndandaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>« Mɛ, mɛ in'wà un'te a vin a ndandaa, Taaràmɛ wà ŋawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Nde afàtsul kɔkà lanswà alà amu mɛ anà mpa làfàtwà, wɛɛ nde afàsaal la akwà làfàtwà, ntɔn la làbör mbɛŋ asin mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Bɛ, bɛ làbà aŋàpɔŋà itaan ntɔn ndaa kàlakyään mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Làkäl amu mɛ, asànaa in'wà mɛ amu bɛ. Akà kɔkà làmwɛy làkwe anki mubɔr mbɛŋ la ŋakwo isàkal naa la kà là aŋànääm anki a mbiim a un'te, itàkal bɛ sye, bɛ làkwo anki mubɔr mbɛŋ, isàkal naa bɛ, bɛ làbà anki amu mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'wà mbiim a un'te a vin, bɛ, bɛ làbà an'kɔkà. Mbuur awà amu mɛ, anà mɛ amu nde, nde afàbɔr mbɛŋ mbɔɔn. Ntɔn bɛ, bɛ làkwe anki mukyer akà undiir mwɛy ukɔɔn mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Mbuur mpa awà amu mɛ, nde wàŋàpiy u nsà, asànaa kɔkà, laa uyɔm nde. An'kɔkà aŋàyɔm bàkyer afàköŋà, bàtɔɔm u mbaa, waa ma ikuŋà. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Isàkal naa bɛ, bɛ làbà amu mɛ, ndaa amɛ sye yà amu bɛ, bɛ làsàlɔm undiir wanswà làsàkwen bɛ, bɛ làsàwal wa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ndaa ifàpà Taaràmɛ làkoo yà naa bɛ làbɔ̈r mbɛŋ mbɔɔn, waa bɛ làsàkal alɔŋki amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Abun, asànaa kan'kwen Taa, mɛ sye amàlakwen. Làkäl uboo a ukwen amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Isàkal naa bɛ làfàsyääl nswɛɛŋ amɛ, bɛ làbà uboo a ukwen amɛ, asànaa kàkwey mɛ nswɛɛŋ a Taaràmɛ, mɛ in'wà uboo a ukwen ande. »<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>« An'tɛn mɛ a bɛ abà, ntɔn un'sak amɛ ukäl uboo abɛ, anà wa sye ukäl wàŋàkwo. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Le nswɛɛŋ amɛ ayi: làkwen bɛ a bɛ asànaa in'fàlakwen mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Kà we anà mbuur mwɛy anki awe anà ukwen a kölàköl isàkɔɔn akal asànaa mukɔɔb mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ntɔn asam ande. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Bɛ làbasam amɛ isàkal naa bɛ làfàkyer indiir in'fàlàswaŋ mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Mɛ alàbel anki asyääl, ntɔn un'syääl uyöb anki ayufàkyer nkum ande. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ alabel asam, ntɔn ndaa yanswà kàwem mɛ akà Taaràmɛ, mɛ ya akyàlaswaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Kà bɛ anki lan'sɔ̈ɔ̈l, mɛ kàlasɔ̈ɔ̈l, mɛ kàlasi ntɔn bɛ làkyen, làbör mbɛŋ, waa mbɛŋ abɛ ilam. Abun, undiir wanswà làsàlɔm bɛ akà Taa kikɔb amɛ, nde akyer asàlapà wa. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Undiir alàswaŋ mɛ awà: làkwen bɛ a bɛ. »<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛɛn man'yiiŋ Yɛsu anà bànde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>« Isàkal naa mɛɛn mà màmàlayiiŋ, làyöb naa mɛ in'wà mbuur atàtwɛb kàyiiŋ ma. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Ilàkal naa bɛ làkäl baar a mɛɛn, mɛɛn ikyer alàlakwen ntɔn bɛ làbà baar ama. Wɛɛ bɛ kà làbà baar ande anki: ntɔn kàlasi mɛ ukɔl, undiir awun mɛɛn màlayiiŋ ma. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Làyɔbà ndaa kàlakyään mɛ: "Un'lɔŋki ukwe anki ulyaŋ un'lɔɔŋ ande." Isàkal naa ba mɛ ban'mɛɛy nkwaaŋ, ba bɛ sye bàsàlamɛɛy nkwaaŋ. Isàkal naa ba bàkäär ndaa amɛ, ba bàsàkaar sye yàbɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Wɛɛ indiir abi byanswà ba bàsàlakyer ntɔn ikɔb amɛ, ntɔn ba bàyöb anki mbuur kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ilàkal naa mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n ayà anà in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n akakyään, ba bàlàkal anki anà man'be. Wɛɛ apanà, ba undiir afàkur watɛy ntɔn man'be aba. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Mbuur kàman'yiiŋ, nde kan'yiiŋ sye Taaràmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Ilàkal naa mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n akàkyer isal abi uboboo a ba, isal mpa kàkwe mbuur asin mukyer, ba bàlàkal anki anà man'be. Apanà ba bàkyàman bya, wɛɛ ba bàmufiyiiŋ, mɛ anà Taaràmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Wɛɛ ya yà ntɔn ndaa bàsön uboo un'kɔɔn aba ikwe: "Ba ban'yiiŋ abunàbun." »<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>« Mpal usàyà un'lɛɛl in'sàlatööm mɛ kà ikɔb a Taa, Dweelà a ndandaa lan'fà akà Taa, nde asan'tɛɛl imbäl. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Anà bɛ sye, bɛ làsan'tɛɛl imbäl, ntɔn bɛ làbà anà mɛ fà nsɛmà. »<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>« Kàlakyään mɛ indiir abi, ntɔn bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwiy làkwikilà abɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Bàkyer asàlaböŋ u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Yumwɛy ayi: taaŋ làmuyà, mbuur asàladwa asàsi naa nde wàmupà ibɔɔn akà Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Bàsàkyer ba abà, ntɔn ba bàyöb anki itàkal Taa, itàkal mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Wɛɛ kàlayäm mɛ indiir abi, ntɔn umpal làsàkwo taaŋ, bɛ, bɛ làsàyɔbà naa mɛ, mɛ kàkyàlayäm ya.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Isal a Dweelà Inkyɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">« Mɛɛ ya kàlasam anki fà nsɛmà, ntɔn mɛ kàkälà anà bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Apanà, mɛ in'wàmukyà akà mbuur kan'töm, wɛɛ akà mwɛy uboo a bɛ kan'fuul anki naa: "Ngye ken akyà?" <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Wɛɛ, ntɔn amàlasam mɛ abà, undiir awun mpem abɛ yan'yɔl ya a ngyɛb. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Mpalabà, mɛ amàlasam ubwaŋàbwaŋ: yan'söön mfun akà bɛ naa mɛ, mɛ in'kyen. Wɛɛ kya mɛ impàkyà anki, un'lɛɛl akwà alàyà mukàlabay, uyàfàyà anki akà bɛ. Wɛɛ isàkal naa mɛ an'kyà, mɛ in'kyer asàlatööm awà. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Waa mpal usàyà nde, nde asàswaŋ ubwaŋàbwaŋ muyöb man'be aba, balàbal anà nsaŋ a Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>U ndaa iler man'be, ntɔn ba bàfàsà anki làkwikilà amu mɛ, <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>u ndaa iler balàbal, ntɔn mɛ in'kyà akà Taa anà bɛ làfàsan'man anki, <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>u ndaa iler nsaŋ, mfum afàyaal mɛɛn bàyun'tsüül nsaŋ. »<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>« Mɛ, mɛ in'we anà indiir mbɔɔn mukàlasam, wɛɛ papanà bɛ làkwo anki mukaar bya u mpem abɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Utaaŋ usàyà Dweelà a ndandaa, nde asàlatwaal unsà ndandaa yanswà. Ntɔn nde usàtɛn anki kà ukwen ande ŋakwo, nde asàtɛn ndaa yanswà usàwem nde anà asàkyään ndaa yanswà isàyà. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Nde asan'sà làkoo, ntɔn nde asàwal ndaa amɛ, waa usàlakyään ya. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Indiir byanswà abyà byàtaa, bya sye byà byàmɛ. Undiir awun in'tɛn mɛ naa Dweelà asàwal unsà byàmɛ, waa usàlakyään bya.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyɛb isàbulà un'sak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>« Itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy, bɛ làsàfan'man anki, apan sye, ungö a taaŋ ikikye, bɛ làkyer asàfan'man. » <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Apan, amwɛy uboo a alɔŋki ande bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Ininà nde ukwen mutɛn a bi naa: "Itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy, bɛ làfàsan'man anki, apan sye, ungö a taaŋ ikikye, làkyer afàsan'man", anà sye: "Ntɔn mɛ in'kyà akà Taa"? <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>"Taaŋ ikikye" utɛɛnà nde ikaswaŋà aben? Bi ikayöbà anki naa ininà nde utɛɛnà! » <verse eid="JHN 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yɛsu kàyöb nde naa ba bàkwen mukun'fuul, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ làbàmuleŋ uboo a bɛ muyöb naa mɛ ininà in'kwen mutɛn: "Itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy, bɛ làfàsan'man anki, apan sye, ungö a taaŋ ikikye, bɛ làkyer afàsan'man." <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään, bɛ, bɛ làkyer asàlel anà làsàsà un'saabà, mpal isàkal mɛɛn musaŋ. Bɛ làsàkal u ngyɛb, wɛɛ ngyɛb abɛ isàbulà un'sak. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Umpal ufàkal un'kaar anà in'swaŋ, mpem ande ifàkal udu udu ntɔn taaŋ ande lan'kwo. Wɛɛ isàkal naa nde kan'bɔr, nde afàdiimà usaay abà banswà, waa usaŋ ntɔn kan'bɔr nde mwan. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Lalan ŋàbawà bɛ làbà u ngyɛb mbɔɔn. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'kyer afàsàlaman, mpem abɛ isàkal unsà un'sak, mbuur asàladuum wa watɛy.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>« Abun, ilä akin, akà undiir mwɛy bɛ làfàsan'fuul anki. Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ alàkyään, undiir wanswà làsàlɔm bɛ akà Taa, nde akyer asàlapà wa kà ikɔb amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Tii apanà, akà undiir mwɛy bɛ ŋàtàlɔm anki kà ikɔb amɛ. Làlɔ̈m, waa bɛ làsàwal, ntɔn un'sak abɛ ukàl wàŋàkwo. »<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'tɛn kà imɛɛy a alɔŋki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>« Indiir abi mɛ kàtɛn a bɛ unsà nsim. Taaŋ làmuyà, alà mpa in'fàsàlasam mɛ abà, wɛɛ alà in'sàlakyään mɛ kà imɛɛy ndaa iler Taa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Ilä akin, bɛ làsàlɔm akà Taa kà ikɔb amɛ, mɛ in'tɛn anki naa mɛ in'sàlalɔ̈ɔ̈m akà Taa, <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>ntɔn Taa akyàlakwen nde ŋakwo, ntɔn lan'kwen bɛ anà làsi bɛ làkwikilà naa mɛ kàfü akà Nzam. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Mɛ, mɛ kàtoo amu Taa, waa mɛ kàyi u mɛɛn. Apanà, mɛ in'wàmulwomà u mɛɛn anà mufurà akà Taa. » <verse eid="JHN 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Alɔŋki bàtɛn a nde naa: « Le, apanà ngye an'tɛn kà imɛɛy, ukɔɔn asyääl nsim. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Apanà bi kan'yöb naa ngye ayöb indiir byanswà, anà ngye mfun yatɛy naa mbuur kafuul ndaa. Undiir awun waa bi kan'sà làkwikilà naa ngye an'fà akà Nzam. » <verse eid="JHN 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Nkye apanà bɛ lan'sà làkwikilà? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Le, taaŋ làmuyà, apanà la lan'kwo, alà làsàtà bɛ upay, mbuur mbuur a mbwo ande, làsan'wɛy bɛ aŋàyen. Wɛɛ mɛ kà in'wà aŋàyen anki, ntɔn Taa wà anà mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Amàlakyään mɛ indiir abi ntɔn bɛ làkäl anà duu amu mɛ. Bɛ làbà uboo a lingyoomà u mɛɛn mà. Wɛɛ làkäl anà un'kanà, mɛ, mɛ mɛɛn akyun'wal iböŋ! »<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngyamàkà a Yɛsu ntɔn alɔŋki ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Ungö kàtɛn nde abà, Yɛsu kàler u du, waa kàtɛn naa: « Taa, taaŋ lan'kwo, mɛɛy làkoo a Mwan angye, ntɔn nde sye umɛɛy làkoo angye. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Ngye kun'pɛ ikɔ̈b udu a baar banswà, ntɔn nde upɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye akà baar kun'pɛ ngye. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Wɛɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye wà naa ba bàyöb ngye mpɛl, Nzam a ndandaa, anà bàyöb Yɛsu Klistɔ, awà kàtöm ngye. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Mɛ, mɛ kàkyapà làkoo u mɛɛn. Mɛ akyàmay isal akyan'pɛ ngye mukyer. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Apanà, ngye, Taa, mpɛ làkoo akwà kàkäl mɛ alà akà ngye, kusà mɛɛn mukal. <verse eid="JHN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>Mɛ, mɛ ngye akyamɛɛy akà baar akwà kàtwey ngye u mɛɛn ntɔn mukan'pà. Ba bàkäl bàngye, waa ngye kan'mpɛ abà, waa ba bàkäär ndaa angye. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Apanà, ba ban'yöb naa indiir byanswà kan'mpɛ ngye, byan'fà akà ngye. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ntɔn mɛ ba kapɛ ndaa kan'mpɛ ngye. Ba ya bàkyàwal. Ba bàkyàyöb ndandaa naa mɛ kàtoo amu ngye, waa ba bàsi làkwikilà naa ngye kan'töm. »<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>« Ngyamàkà amɛ yà ntɔn ba. Mɛ in'yamà anki ntɔn mɛɛn, wɛɛ ntɔn baar kan'pɛ ngye, ntɔn ba bà bàngye. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Indiir byanswà in'wà mɛ abyà, byà byàngye. Indiir awà ngye abyà, byà byàmɛ. Mɛ kàwɛl làkoo amu ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Mɛ in'fàkal anki u mɛɛn, wɛɛ ba, ba bà u mɛɛn. Mɛ in'wàmukyà akà ngye. Taa In'kyɛɛl, aler unsà ikɔ̈b a ikɔb angye, ikɔ̈b akwà kan'pɛ ngye, ntɔn ba bàkäl mwɛy asànaa ibà bi mwɛy. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Umpal kàkäl mɛ anà ba, mɛ, mɛ ba kàfalerà kà ikɔ̈b a ikɔb angye kan'pɛ ngye. Mɛ ba afàkyer atii, lalan, akà umwɛy kàdiimà anki, nà mwan aŋàdiimà mbwo, ntɔn Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ikwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Apanà, mɛ in'kyà akà ngye. Indiir abi mɛ an'tɛn umpal in'wà mɛ u mɛɛn, ntɔn ba bàkäl anà un'sak amɛ u mpem aba, un'sak wàŋàkwo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Mɛ, mɛ kapɛ ndaa angye, baar a mɛɛn bàkyer ayiiŋ, ntɔn ba kà bà baar a mɛɛn anki, asànaa mɛ mpa in'wà mɛ wàmɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'löm anki naa ngye alwom u mɛɛn, wɛɛ mukatii ntɔn Ŋube. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Ba kà baar a mɛɛn anki, asànaa mpa in'wà mɛ mbuur a mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Asi ukɔl ntɔn ngye u mbwo a ndandaa: ndaa angye yà ndandaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Asànaa kan'töm ngye u mɛɛn, mɛ sye ba amatɔm u mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Mɛ an'sà ndür amɛ ŋakwo akà ngye ntɔn ba, ntɔn ba sye bàkäl bàngye ndandaa. »<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>« Mɛ in'yamà anki ntɔn ba mpɛl, wɛɛ sye ntɔn baar abà bàsàsà làkwikilà aba amu mɛ u mbwo a an'lɔɔŋ aba. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Wɛy ba banswà bàkäl mwɛy, asànaa ngye, Taa, ngye awà amu mɛ anà mɛ in'wà amu ngye, wɛy ba sye bàkäl mwɛy amu bi, ntɔn mɛɛn màyöb naa ngye kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Mɛ, mɛ ba akyapà làkoo kan'pɛ ngye, ntɔn ba bàkäl mwɛy, asànaa naa bi ibà bi mwɛy: <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>mɛ amu ba, ngye amu mɛ, ntɔn ba bàkäl bàŋakwo mwɛy, waa mɛɛn màyöb naa ngye kan'töm, naa ngye ba akyakwen asànaa kan'kwen ngye. <verse eid="JHN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>Taa, mɛ in'kwen naa ikal in'wà mɛ, ba sye bàkäl paa, anà ba bàmɛn làkoo kan'pɛ ngye kusà a nkyeer a mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Taa a balàbal, mpal mpa mayöb mɛɛn, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ kàkyayöb, ba abà bàkyàyöb naa ngye kan'töm. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Mɛ kàkyer naa ba bàyöb ikɔb angye, mɛ in'yàfàkyer naa ba bàyöb kya, ntɔn ukwen kan'kwen ngye bàkäl amu ba, anà mɛ in'käl amu ba. »<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Nköör a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Màt 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Ungö mutɛn abà, Yɛsu kàkyen anà alɔŋki ande u sim a un'lwɛy bàfàbel Sɛdrɔn. Akun làkäl anà làpaŋ làmwɛy, waa kàkàbilà kwo anà alɔŋki ande. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Kyekà Yudasi, mbuur kun'yälà, kàkyàyöb ikal aki, ntɔn Yɛsu kàfakyeenà kwo mbalà mbɔɔn anà alɔŋki ande. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Nde kàkäl kusà a un'lwaŋ a aŋità bun'pɛ andweer a angaŋ anà Amfarisi, waa kàbilà u làpaŋ anà isüü a mbaa, anà mwinà anà an'tà. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàyöb indiir byanswà byun'yeel, nde kàkyen mper akà ba, anà kafuul naa: « Nà bɛ làyileŋ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Yɛsu, un'nsi Nasàlɛr. » Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ awà. » Kyekà, uboo a ba, Yudasi, mbuur kun'yälà, kàkäl mwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Umpal kàtɛn Yɛsu a ba naa: « Mɛ awà », ba bàfurà lingö, waa bàbü u mɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yɛsu kàfafuul naa: « Nà bɛ làyileŋ? » Ba naa: « Yɛsu, un'nsi Nasàlɛr. » <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Mɛ in'kyàtɛn a bɛ, mɛ awà. Isàkal naa bɛ mɛ làyileŋ, abun lawɛy baar bumwɛy bà bàkyen kàba. »<verse eid="JHN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Abun yàlàkwo ndaa kàtɛn Yɛsu naa: « Uboo a baar kan'pɛ ngye, mɛ akà umwɛy kàpiy anki. » <verse eid="JHN 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Apan, Simɔn Petɔlà kàkäl anà kɔm, nde kàswam la kà inkwà, kàkäm la un'tsüüŋ a undweer a angaŋ, waa la lun'ywaaŋ tsü là ibaal. Un'tsüüŋ awà ikɔb ande kyàkäl Malkusu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a Petɔlà naa: « Fuur kɔm angye uboo a inkwà a la. Nkye mɛ in'sànwà anki kɔɔb kan'pɛ Taa munwà? »<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmun'twaal kusà a An</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Apan, iköŋ a aŋità anà mfum aba, anà aleer a amfum a Ayudà, bàkör Yɛsu, waa bun'läl in'siŋ. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Ba bàtun'syen akà An. Nde kàkäl ukwà a Kayifa, undweer a angaŋ u mbul awun. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kyekà Kayifa awà, wà mbuur kàpɛ amfum a Ayudà lwɛŋ naa: « Yà mfun naa mbuur mwɛy ukü ntɔn un'sɛŋ a baar. »<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petɔlà kan'tɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Màt 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mlk 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simɔn Petɔlà anà un'lɔŋki wumwɛy bàyilabà Yɛsu. Undweer a Angaŋ kàkyun'yöb un'lɔŋki awà. Nde kàbilà mbwo mwɛy anà Yɛsu u làpaŋ a undweer a angaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kàkäl u nsà, tsütsü a munàmbwo. Abun, un'lɔŋki awà kàyöb Undweer a Angaŋ, kàyàtoo nde, kàyäm a un'kaar kàkäl un'leer a munàmbwo, waa nde kàbiil Petɔlà. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Apan, un'syääl a un'kaar, un'leer a munàmbwo, kàtɛn a Petɔlà naa: « Nkye ngye, ngye sye kawumwɛy anki uboo a alɔŋki a mbuur awunà? » Petɔlà kun'fuur naa: « Aay, kà mɛ anki. »<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Asyääl anà aleer bàyöbà böl a mbaa a an'kal, waa bàyörà ya, ntɔn mpye yàkyer akal. Petɔlà sye kàkäl paa muywar mbaa anà ba.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Undweer a Angaŋ wàmufuul Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Màt 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Apan, un'dweer a angaŋ kàfuul Yɛsu unsà ndaa iler alɔŋki anà an'lɔɔŋ ande. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ kàtɛɛnà kimɛɛy akà baar. Taaŋ lanswà, mɛ kàyilɔɔŋà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà anà u ndwà a Nzam, ikal bàfàköŋ Ayudà banswà. Akundiir mwɛy wàŋàyee kàtɛn mɛ watɛy. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Ntɔn nkye an'fuulà ngye? Fuul baar bàwem ndaa kàtɛn mɛ, ba bàkyàyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ ndaa kàtɛn mɛ! » <verse eid="JHN 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Umwɛy uboo a aleer bàkäl paa, umpal kàwem nde mfuur a Yɛsu ayi, waa kun'käm mbar, anà mutɛn naa: « Nkye ngye undweer a angaŋ un'fuur abwɛy? » <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ an'tɛn ube, swaŋ ba. Isàkal naa mɛ an'tɛn ubwaŋ, ntɔn nkye aman'kam ngye mbar? » <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Apan, An kun'töm wàŋàbäm in'siŋ akun'dweer a angaŋ Kayifa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petɔlà kan'fàtɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Màt 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mlk 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Utaaŋ nsil alan, Simɔn Petɔlà kàkälà paa, wàmuywar mbaa. Ba bun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye sye awumwɛy uboo a alɔŋki ande? » Petɔlà waa kàtön: « Ŋaa, kà mɛ anki. » <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Umwɛy uboo a asyääl a undweer a angaŋ, un'tɔŋ a mbuur awà kàywaaŋ Petɔlà tsü ande, kàtɛn naa: « Nkye mɛ kamɛn anki anà nde uboo a làpaŋ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Wɛɛ Petɔlà waa kàfun'tɔn. Utaaŋ nsil alan, nkɔɔ mwɛy waa kàbel.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kusà a Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Màt 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Apan, ba bàsyen Yɛsu u ndwà a kuvɛrnɔ̈ɔ̈r fà ndwà a Kayifa. Yàkäl ututu. Baar bun'twäl bàkyer atɔn mubilà u ndwà a kuvɛrnɔ̈ɔ̈r, ntɔn mukɔɔn asà ndür aba làbiin anà ba bàdi Pak. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Abun, kuvɛrnɔ̈ɔ̈r Pilatu kàyaman u nsà, waa kafuul naa: « Undiir nà lan'füün bɛ mbuur wà? » <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Ilàkal naa mbuur awà ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akyer ube, bi ilatwääl awà anki. » <verse eid="JHN 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Abun, Pilatu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Lun'wɛl, lun'tsüül nsaŋ bɛ ŋakwo unsà un'kɔɔn abɛ. » Ba bun'fuur naa: « Bi ikɔ̈b mutsüül mbuur mbar a ukwà kyatɛy. »<verse eid="JHN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Kyakin, yàkwe ndaa kàtɛn Yɛsu muswaŋ naa nde kàlàkwà aben. <verse eid="JHN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Apan, Pilatu kàfurà u ndwà, waa kàswɛŋ naa bun'twääl Yɛsu. Nde kun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye, ngye awà mfum a Ayudà? » <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Nkye ngye an'tɛn unsà an'kyän angye ŋakwo lɛɛ baar asin bàmakyään ntɔn mɛ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilatu kàfuur naa: « Nkye mɛ, mɛ in'wà Un'yudà? Baar a nsi angye anà amfum a angaŋ bàmayälà akà mɛ! Ininà ngye an'kyer? » <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Imwol amɛ kà kyà mɛɛn mà tɛy. Ilàkal naa kya ikäl kyà mɛɛn mà, asyääl amɛ bàlàkyer an'nwään naa bàkɔɔn an'yälà akamfum a Ayudà. Ŋaa, imwol amɛ kà kyà mɛɛn mà anki. » <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Apan, Pilatu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Iswaŋà naa ngye awà mfum? » Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ngye an'tɛn ngye ŋakwo naa mɛ in'wà mfum. Mɛ, bàkyer an'bɔr, waa mɛ kàyi u mɛɛn ntɔn mutà imbäl akà ndandaa. Mbuur wanswà awunsà ndandaa afàwem ndaa amɛ. » – <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilatu kun'fuul naa: « Ndandaa ininà? »</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yɛsu bàmutsüül mbar a ukwà</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Màt 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mlk 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ungö a ngɔk ayi, Pilatu kàfàkàman amfum a Ayudà u nsà, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ akà undiir in'mɛn anki kan'kwo mutsüül mbuur wà mbar a ukwà. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Wɛɛ asànaa akyà kya ifà abɛ naa mɛ alàwɛɛy mbuur mwɛy kun'kyɔm a Pak, nkye bɛ làkyàkwen naa mɛ in'wɛy mfum a Ayudà? » <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Apan ba banswà bàfàsà in'kwɛŋ: « Ŋaa, kà nde tɛy, wɛɛ Banabasi! » Kyekà, Banabasi awà kàkäl un'dwää baar.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Apan, Pilatu kàswɛŋ mutwal Yɛsu anà mukun'kam an'füm. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Aŋità bàtöŋ nkar a nsyeenà, waa bun'bwä ya kun'tswe. Ba bun'bwä sye kàzak a tsöö. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Ba bàsinà tsütsü apà nde, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Mfum a Ayudà, mbɔr angye! » Ba bun'kämà mbar.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilatu kàkyer afàtoo, waa kàtɛn a amfum a Ayudà naa: « Làler, mɛ in'kyer alatwääl awà u nsà: bɛ làkyer ayöb naa mɛ in'mɛn anki ube kan'kyer nde. » <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Abun, Yɛsu kàyàtoo wàŋàbwaar nkar a nsyeenà anà kàzak a tsöö. Pilatu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Le baal! » <verse eid="JHN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Pa bun'mɛn andweer a angaŋ anà aleer, ba bàsi in'kwɛŋ: « Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! » Pilatu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Lun'wɛl anà lun'bɛɛrà bɛ ŋakwo u kulunsi, wɛɛ akà mɛ, mɛ in'mɛn anki undiir kan'kwo mukun'tsüül mbar a ukwà. » <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Amfum a Ayudà bun'fuur naa: « Bi iwe anà un'kɔɔn, mulab un'kɔɔn awà, nde akyer akwà, ntɔn nde kàkyeyà uyɔl naa nde wà Mwan a Nzam. » <verse eid="JHN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Mpal kàwem Pilatu ndaa ayi, nde kàfàman bɔɔmà mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Nde kàfurà u ndwà, waa kàfuul Yɛsu naa: « Ngye, ngye awà un'nsi nà? » Wɛɛ Yɛsu kun'fuur anki akundiir. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Apan, Pilatu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye an'tɔn mukan'pà mfuur? Nkye ngye ayöb anki naa mɛ, mɛ in'we anà ikɔ̈b mukawɛy itàkal mukabɛɛrà u kulunsi? » <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ngye ikɔ̈b alàkal akyà anki, ilàkal naa Nzam ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akapà kya. Undiir awun, mbuur awà kàman'yälà akà ngye, we anà man'be màŋàsöönà. »<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Fà apan, Pilatu kàleŋà mukun'wɛy. Wɛɛ amfum a Ayudà bàsi in'kwɛŋ: « Isàkal naa ngye amun'wɛy, ngye kawà un'sam a Sɛzar anki! Mbuur wanswà afàkyey uyɔl naa nde wà mfum, nde kan'kyey naa nde wà ŋankir a Sɛzar! » <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Mpal kàwem Pilatu ndaa ayi, nde kàsyen Yɛsu u nsà, kàbwaay u làbay a nsaŋ, kikal bàfàbel naa « Plase pavɛ » - unsà ɛbɛlyɔ naa « Ngabàtà ». <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Kya kyàkäl ilä mulɔ̈ɔ̈n un'kyɔm a Pak u midi. Pilatu kàtɛn a Ayudà naa: « Le mfum abɛ! » <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Wɛɛ ba bàsɛmà musà in'kwɛŋ: « Ukü! Ukü! Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! » Pilatu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye mɛ in'bɛɛrà mfum abɛ u kulunsi? » Andweer a angaŋ bàfuur naa: « Bi mfum asin watɛy, Sɛzar mpɛl. » <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Apan Pilatu wa kapɛ awà ntɔn bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Mbɛɛrà a Yɛsu u kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Màt 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Apan ba bàsyen Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yɛsu kàyisyeenà kulunsi ande, nde ŋakwo, nde kàtoo u nsà a bul ntɔn mukyà ikal akyà bàfàbel naa « Bɔl a un'tswe », unsà ɛbɛlyɔ bàfàbel « Ngɔlɔngɔta ». <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Akun ba bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi anà baar, baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l: mwɛy u kɔɔ a ibaal, mwey u kɔɔ a ikaar, Yɛsu uboboo. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilatu kàsön isɔn udu a kilàbää, waa kàbɛɛrà kya udu a kulunsi. Kya kyàkäl aŋàsön naa: « Yɛsu un'nsi Nasàlɛr, mfum a Ayudà. » <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Ayudà mbɔɔn bàtäŋà isɔn abi, ntɔn ikal bàbɛɛrà Yɛsu u kulunsi kyàkäl tsütsü a bul, anà isɔn bya sye bàsön unsà ibɛlyɔ, unsà ilatɛ anà unsà ingɛlɛki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Abun, andweer a angaŋ a Ayudà bàtɛn a Pilatu naa: « Twon an'sɔn naa "mfum a Ayudà", wɛɛ sɔn naa: "mbuur wà kàkyey uyɔl naa nde kàkäl mfum a Ayudà." » <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilatu kàfuur naa: « Ayan'sɔn mɛ, mɛ an'sɔn ya. »<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Mpal ban'may aŋità mun'bɛɛrà Yɛsu u kulunsi, ba bàwɛl ipfɛy ande, bàsi bya an'kab an'nà, mbuur mbuur kàwɛl kab làmwɛy. Làsàsal nà kàzak ande. La làkäl anki làŋàtsum: ipfɛy mwɛy fà du tii u ngyɛl. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Aŋità bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Wɛy bi ikɔ̈ɔ̈n akaam kya, wɛɛ bi itɔɔm löb, ntɔn muyöb naa nà awal kya. » Ntɔn naa Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ikwe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">« Ba bàsi ipfɛy amɛ an'kab</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">anà ba bàtɔɔm löb ntɔn kàzak amɛ. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Byabi indiir bàkyer aŋità.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Baar bàkäl tsütsü a kulunsi anà Yɛsu babà: ngwän, mpääŋ a ngwän, Màlye un'kyay a Kɔlɔpasi, anà Màlye un'nsi Makdalà. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yɛsu kàmɛn nde ngwän anà un'lɔŋki kàfakweenà nde ukɔl a nde, nde kàtɛn a ngwän naa: « Un'kaar, le mwan angye wàbaal. » <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Ungö waa kàtɛn a un'lɔŋki naa: « Le ngwa. » Fà apan, un'lɔŋki kun'wɛl u ndwà ande.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkweel a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Màt 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Ungö a ndaa ayi, nde kàyöb naa indiir byanswà byakyàkwo itaan, ntɔn Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ikwe, Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Mfwää yàman'kaar. » <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Paa làkäl anà làbuuŋ aŋàyɔl a vin a nyän, ba bàbäm ikaam a ipfɛy aŋànwɛmà unsà vin a nyän alan u nswɛŋ a kɔkà a kite bàfàbel naa isɔp, waa bun'bämà kya u mun. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Pa kànü nde vin a nyän alà, nde kàtɛn naa: « Yanswà yan'kwo! » Abun, nde kàtsülà un'tswe, waa kàfuur mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋità mwɛy kan'tuub bɛl a nsyäärà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Kya kyàkäl ilä ayöŋà un'kyɔm a saba. Ntɔn mukɔɔn awɛy ndom isinakalà u kulunsi ilä a saba, ntɔn kya kyàkäl ilä a kölàköl, amfum a Ayudà bàkàlɔm mbwo akà Pilatu ntɔn bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l ya in'kɔl anà bàlwom ya. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Apan, aŋità bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l in'kɔl a mbuur atàtwɛb anà myà mbuur wàyweel bàbɛɛrà u kulunsi mbwo mwɛy a Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Mpal bàkɔlà ba apà Yɛsu, ba bun'mɛn wàŋàkwà, waa mpa bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈l in'kɔl. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Wɛɛ umwɛy uboo a aŋità, kun'kül kwaŋ u bɛl a nsyäärà, apan sye an'kil anà an'dà waa màyàtoo. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Mbuur kàmɛn ya, kàtɛ imbäl. Imbäl ande kyà ndandaa. Nde, nde akyàyöb naa nde kan'tɛn ndandaa ntɔn bɛ sye làsi làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Abun, indiir abi byàyi ntɔn Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ikwe: « Bàsun'bɔɔl anki akun'kwo ande mwɛy. » <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Ntsü yumwɛy, Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛn naa: « Ileer aba isàkal akà mbuur bàkül ba kwaŋ. »<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiil a ndom a Yɛsu kan'dii.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Màt 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Ungö a indiir abi, un'lɔŋki a Yɛsu mwɛy ikɔb ande Yɔsɛfi, un'nsi Alimatɛ, kàkyen akà Pilatu u nku, ntɔn bɔɔmà a Ayudà, mulɔm mbwo mulwom ndom a Yɛsu. Pilatu waa kàkyey. Abun, Yɔsɛfi kàkàlwom ya. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nàkàdim sye, mbuur akwà kàkyen mukàman Yɛsu u mpib, kàtwäl isii an'kilɔ an'kwem an'tär mà may a usɔŋ mà mir àŋàtüüb anà alɔwɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàwɛl ndom a Yɛsu, bàläl ya ikaam a ipfɛy a linɔ, bàtyaŋ ya may a usɔŋ, asànaa awà ifà a Ayudà bàfàdyee ba akü aba. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Kikal bàbɛɛrà Yɛsu u kulunsi làkäl anà làpaŋ. Uboo a la màkäl anà an'dii akün, mpa amàŋàtàsà mbuur akikikye. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Abun, ba Yɛsu bun'tɔ̈l kwo, ntɔn ngyööŋ a Ayudà anà an'dii sye màkäl tsütsü.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">An'dii a ipɔl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Màt 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Ututu a ilä atàtwɛb kyà mpɔsà, u kilàpib, Màlye un'nsi Makdalà kàkyen an'dii, waa kàmɛn nkɔŋ yàŋàlwomà. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Apan, nde kàwurà ntiin, kàkàman Simɔn Petɔlà anà un'lɔŋki kàfakweenà Yɛsu, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mwol bàkyun'lwom kan'dii, bi iyöb anki naa bàmusà ken. » <verse eid="JHN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Petɔlà anà un'lɔŋki wumwɛy waa bàkyen an'dii. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàwurà ntiin, wɛɛ un'lɔŋki wumwɛy kàyiwurà aŋàlyaŋ Petɔlà, waa kàkàkɔlà mbuur atàtwɛb kan'dii. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Nde kànyee ntɔn muler, waa kàmɛn ikaam a ipfɛy a linɔ byàŋàtɔɔl u mɛɛn. Wɛɛ nde kàbilà anki uboo a an'dii. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kàyun'labà nde, waa kàyàkɔlà sye. Nde kàbilà uboo a an'dii, waa kàmɛn ikaam a ipfɛy byàŋàtɔɔl u mɛɛn, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>anà ipfɛy bàfwe un'tswe a Yɛsu. Kya kyàkäl anki ikal imwɛy anà ikaam a ipfɛy a linɔ, wɛɛ kya kyàkäl kyàŋàbwɛlà, kyàŋàtɔɔl ikal asin. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Apan, un'lɔŋki akwà kàkàkɔlà kusà kan'dii waa kabilà sye. Nde waa kàmɛn, waa kàsi làkwikilà. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Ntɔn ba bàkäl aŋàtàyöb anki Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ayà itɛɛnà naa Yɛsu kàkyer alàwiyà uboo a akü. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Ungö apan, alɔŋki bàfurà ndwà aba.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu an'kàmɛnà akà Màlye a Makdalà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Màt 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mlk 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Màlye kàkäl u nsà, tsütsü a an'dii, wàmulelà. Umpal kàlelà nde, nde kànye ntɔn muler uboo a an'dii, <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>nde kàmɛn akyeey abɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkyàbwaar ipfɛy a pɛɛl, bàŋàbwaay kikal bàtɔ̈l ndom a Yɛsu, mwɛy ntsü a un'tswe, mwɛy ntsü a in'kɔl. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Akyeey bun'fuul naa: « Un'kaar, ntɔn nkye alelà ngye? » Nde kafuur naa: « Mwol amɛ bàmun'lwom, mɛ in'yöb anki naa bun'si ken. » <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Ungö mutɛn abà, nde kàler ungö, waa kàmɛn Yɛsu kàkyàmbar paa, wɛɛ nde kàyöb anki naa awunà nde. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'kaar, ntɔn nkye alelà ngye? Nà ngye aleŋà? » Wɛɛ nde kàsii naa un'syääl a làpaŋ kàkäl, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, isàkal naa ngye kun'lwom, nkyään, ngye kun'si ken, waa mɛɛ in'kun'wal. » <verse eid="JHN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Màlye! » Nde waa kàbulà, kun'fuur unsà Ibɛlyɔ naa: « Rabuni! », iswaŋà naa « Un'lɔɔŋ ». <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Twon aman'ba, ntɔn mɛ ŋàtàbeenà anki akà Taaràmɛ. Wɛɛ kyen kakyään atɔŋ amɛ naa mɛ an'beenà akà Taaràmɛ awà Taaràbɛ sye, akà Nzam amɛ awà Nzam abɛ sye. » <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Abun, Màlye un'si Makdalà kàkyen akalɔŋki, waa kasam naa: « Mɛ, mɛ an'man Mwol, le ndaa kan'kyään nde. »<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'mɛnà akalɔŋki ande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Màt 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Làsisye a ilä nsil aki, ilä atàtwɛb kyà mpɔsà, alɔŋki bàkàköŋ u ndwà, ibeenà byàkäl byàŋàdübà a in'kaŋàboo, ntɔn ba bàtiinà bɔɔmà a amfum a Ayudà. Yɛsu waa kàyi, kàmbär uboboo a ba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Duu làkäl anà bɛ! » <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Ungö mutɛn abà, nde kamɛɛy an'kɔɔ anà bɛl a nsyäärà ande. Alɔŋki banswà bàkäl unsà un'sak muman Mwol. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Duu làkäl anà bɛ! Asànaa kan'töm Taa, mɛ, mɛ sye amàlatɔm. » <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Ungö a ndaa ayi, nde kafül un'swey, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làwɛl Dweelà In'kyɛɛl! <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Akà baar abà làsàdwääl bɛ nkul a man'be aba, ba bàsàwal ndwääl a nkul. Wɛɛ akà baar mpa làsàdwääl bɛ nkul, ba ya sye bàsàwal anki. »<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Tuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Kyekà Tuma awà bàfàbel Didimɔ, umwɛy uboo a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel kàkäl anki anà ba umpal kàyi Yɛsu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Abun, alɔŋki bumwɛy bun'kyään naa: « Bi kan'man Mwol. » Wɛɛ nde kafuur naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ in'mɛn anki idiim a in'sàmar kan'kɔɔ ande, isàkal naa mɛ in'külà anki làpin amɛ kikal a in'sàmar anà kɔɔ amɛ u bɛl a nsyäärà ande, mɛ in'sà anki làkwikilà. »<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Wɛɛ ungö a ilä naan, alɔŋki bàfàköŋ u ndwà, Tuma kàkäl anà ba. Ibeenà byanswà byàkäl byàŋàsà in'kaŋàboo. Yɛsu kàyi nde, kàmbär uboboo a ba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Duu làkäl anà bɛ! » <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Ungö waa kàtɛn a Tuma naa: « Sin làpin angye pà, ler an'kɔɔ amɛ. Sin sye kɔɔ angye, fwaar la u bɛl a nsyäärà amɛ. Wɛy mukal un'syeel a mbaaŋ, wɛɛ bulà aŋàlàkwikila! » <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tuma kun'fuur naa: « Mwol amɛ, Nzam amɛ! » <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Nkye ntɔn aman'man ngye, waa ngye an'sà làkwikilà? Un'sak mbɔɔn akà baar mpa bàmɛn, waa bàsi làkwikilà! »<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isin a un'kaan awà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yɛsu kàkyer idiim asin mbɔɔn u mii a alɔŋki ande abyà mpa bàsön uboo a un'kaan awà. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Indiir abi bàsön ntɔn bɛ làsi làkwikilà naa Yɛsu wà Klistɔ, Mwan a Nzam, naa sye u mbwo a làkwikilà alà, bɛ làkäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ kikɔb ande.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'mɛnà akà alɔŋki nsambwaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Ungö a indiir abi, Yɛsu kàfàmɛnà akalɔŋki ande kun'kɔɔl a ɛwà a Tibɛryade. Le, nde kàyàmɛnà aben akà ba: <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simɔn Petɔlà, Tuma - bàfàbel naa Didimɔ, Natanayɛl un'nsi Kana u Ngalilɛ, baan a Zebeday anà alɔŋki bɔ̈ɔ̈l bumwɛy bàkäl ikal imwɛy. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ, mɛ awin'kyà in'kàlwab nsö. » Ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Bi ikyà anà ngye! » Laa bàtoo ba, bàbilà ba u bwaar, wɛɛ u mpib ayin, ba akundiir bàsiim anki. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Taaŋ làkäl lan'tyà, Yɛsu kàkäl aŋàmbar paa kun'kɔɔl a an'dà. Wɛɛ alɔŋki bàyöbà anki naa awun Yɛsu kàkäl. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Baan amɛ, nkye bɛ làwe anà undiir adyà? » Ba bun'fuur naa: « Ŋaa. » <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làtɔɔm an'tɛy u kɔɔ a ibaal a bwaar, waa bɛ làyàman. » Abun, waa ba bàtɔɔm ma, wɛɛ ba bàkwe anki munaan ma, ntɔn nsö yàkäl mbɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Apan, un'lɔŋki kàfakweenà Yɛsu kàtɛn a Petɔlà naa: « Awà Mwol! » Pa kàwem Petɔlà naa Mwol kàkäl, nde kàbwäär ipfɛy, ntɔn nde kàkäl nsàpɔl, waa kàbü kan'dà. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Alɔŋki bumwɛy bàyi anà bwaar, ntɔn munaan an'tɛy màkäl aŋàyɔl a nsö: ba bàkäl anki kwɛl a nkankyel, isii a mɛtre nkam mwɛy. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Utaaŋ bàtɔlà ba u nkankyel, ba bàmɛn böl a an'kal a mbaa anà nsö udu, anà mampà. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làtwääl nsö yumwɛy uboo a nsö lan'siim bɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simɔn Petɔlà kàbilà u bwaar, kànaan an'tɛy u mɛɛn, ma màkäl aŋàyɔl a nsö an'köl an'köl: nkam mwɛy a an'kwem an'tyeen aŋitär. Itàkal naa ya yàkäl un'kàbɔ, an'tɛy màkaamà anki. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yɛsu waa kabel: « Yää, làdi. » Akà un'lɔŋki mwɛy kàkwe anki mukun'fuul naa: « Ngye, ngye nà? » Ntɔn ba bàkiyöbà naa awà Mwol kàkäl. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Abun Yɛsu kàsin nde, nde kàwɛl mampà anà nsö, waa kakääb. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Ayi yàkäl mbalà yàtär ayà kàmɛnà Yɛsu akalɔŋki ande, fà kàwiyà nde uboo a akü.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Petɔlà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Ungö a udyà, Yɛsu kàfuul Simɔn Petɔlà naa: « Simɔn, mwan a Ywan, nkye ngye akyan'kwen aŋàsöön baar bà? » – Nde kàfuur naa: « Inye, Mwol, ngye akyàyöb ngye ŋakwo naa mɛ in'kyakwen. » Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Sey baan a in'kɔk amɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>U mbalà yàyweel, Yɛsu kun'fuul naa: « Simɔn, mwan a Ywan, nkye ngye akyan'kwen? » Nde kàfuur naa: « Inye, Mwol, ngye akyàyöb naa mɛ in'kyakwen. » Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Kal nkyɛɛŋ a in'kɔk amɛ. » <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>U mbalà yàtär, nde kàtɛn a nde naa: « Simɔn, mwan a Ywan, nkye ngye akyan'kwen? » Petɔlà kàmɛn ngyɛb ntɔn kun'fuul Yɛsu mbalà yàtär naa: « Nkye ngye akyan'kwen? » Nde kun'fuur naa: « Mwol, ngye mbuur ayöb ndaa yanswà, ngye akyàyöb naa mɛ, mɛ in'kyakwen! » Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Sey in'kɔk amɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Ndandaa, ndandaa, mɛ akyään: mpal kàkäl ngye un'tö, ngye ŋakwo kàfabäämà un'kab, ngye kàkyeenà ntsü yanswà kàkweenà ngye. Wɛɛ mpal asàbulà ngye un'nün, ngye asayaamà an'kɔɔ angye, waa mbuur asin usabäämà un'kab, nde sye usasyeenà ntsü mpa akwen ngye. » <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Kàtɛn nde abà, Yɛsu kàkwen muswaŋ naa nkweel a Petɔlà isàkal aben ntɔn mupà Nzam làkoo. Ungö mutɛn abà, nde kàtɛn a nde naa: « Yan'läb! »<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà un'lɔŋki kàfakweenà nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Petɔlà kàler ungö, kàmɛn nde un'lɔŋki kàfakweenà Yɛsu - nde akwà kàkàyiir kitɔl ande umpal bàkäl ba mudyà anà kun'fuul naa: « Mwol, nà asayälà? » <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Mpal kun'mɛn Petɔlà, nde kàfuul Yɛsu naa: « Mwol, atöl nde, ininà isàkal? » <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ in'kwen naa nde ukäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ tii mpal in'sàyà mɛ, a akà ngye mwo nkye? Ngye, yan'läb! » <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Fà apan, làsaŋ làpää akatɔŋ naa un'lɔŋki awà usàkwà anki. Kyekà, Yɛsu kàtɛn anki naa un'lɔŋki awà usàkwà anki, wɛɛ nde kàtɛn naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ in'sàkwen naa nde ukäl tii mpal in'sàyà mɛ, a akà ngye mwo nkye? »<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Un'lɔŋki nsil awà, wàmutà imbäl a indiir abi anà kàsön bya, bi ban'yöb naa imbäl ande kyà ndandaa.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntsülà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yɛsu kàkyer indiir asin mbɔɔn. Yàlàkal naa bàsön bya imwɛy imwɛy, mɛ in'sii ikal kyàlàkal anki musà in'kaan myanswà bàlàsɔn.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
